-- en: "Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Committing a field value validates and evaluates once. Run test refreshes the current values, while only valid values are evaluated. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."
L["Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Committing a field value validates and evaluates once. Run test refreshes the current values, while only valid values are evaluated. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."] = "“测试”会从任一回调标签页打开一个条件级对话框。它会结合独立的测试值同时渲染字段界面和帮助。提交一个字段值会验证并评估一次。“运行测试”会刷新当前值，但只评估有效值。打开对话框不会评估默认值。“实时”需手动开启，并在对话框关闭时停止。已提交的测试值可供调试器使用，并与源码、导出内容和循环编辑相互独立。“检查语法”从不运行回调。"
