L["Return the preview window to the center of the screen."] = "将预览窗口移回屏幕中央。"
-- en: "The icon shows your selected profile effect, color, size, anchor and offsets."
L["The icon shows your selected profile effect, color, size, anchor and offsets."] = "图标显示你所选配置文件的效果、颜色、大小、锚点和偏移。"
-- en: "Vertical offset in pixels. Up and Down change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."
L["Vertical offset in pixels. Up and Down change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."] = "以像素为单位的垂直偏移。“上”和“下”可更改它；按住 Shift 每次移动十像素。“居中”会重置两个偏移。"
-- en: "Horizontal offset in pixels. Left and Right change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."
L["Horizontal offset in pixels. Left and Right change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."] = "以像素为单位的水平偏移。“左”和“右”可更改它；按住 Shift 每次移动十像素。“居中”会重置两个偏移。"
