L["Built-in category"] = "内置分类"
-- en: "Delete category"
L["Delete category"] = "删除分类"
-- en: "Delete this category? Its conditions will remain available under Other."
L["Delete this category? Its conditions will remain available under Other."] = "删除此分类？其中的条件仍可在“其他”下使用。"
-- en: "Filter the condition list by All, Switch, Custom, Other or a named category. Search narrows the visible conditions without changing their category."
L["Filter the condition list by All, Switch, Custom, Other or a named category. Search narrows the visible conditions without changing their category."] = "按“全部”“切换”“自定义”“其他”或某个命名分类筛选条件列表。搜索会缩小可见条件的范围，但不改变其分类。"
-- en: "Open Manage categories below the list for category maintenance. Back to conditions returns to individual condition settings."
L["Open Manage categories below the list for category maintenance. Back to conditions returns to individual condition settings."] = "打开列表下方的“管理分类”以维护分类。“返回条件”会回到单个条件的设置。"
-- en: "Rename the selected category in Manage categories. Built-in categories cannot be renamed or deleted."
L["Rename the selected category in Manage categories. Built-in categories cannot be renamed or deleted."] = "在“管理分类”中重命名所选分类。内置分类不能重命名或删除。"
-- en: "Add an empty named category from the category-management list. Move To in condition settings assigns a condition to it."
L["Add an empty named category from the category-management list. Move To in condition settings assigns a condition to it."] = "从分类管理列表中添加一个空的命名分类。条件设置中的“移动到”可将条件分配给它。"
-- en: "In Manage categories, move the selected category earlier in the category list."
L["In Manage categories, move the selected category earlier in the category list."] = "在“管理分类”中，将所选分类在分类列表中前移。"
-- en: "In Manage categories, move the selected category later in the category list."
L["In Manage categories, move the selected category later in the category list."] = "在“管理分类”中，将所选分类在分类列表中后移。"
-- en: "Delete a named category after confirmation. Its conditions remain available under Other; their definitions are preserved."
L["Delete a named category after confirmation. Its conditions remain available under Other; their definitions are preserved."] = "确认后删除一个命名分类。其中的条件仍可在“其他”下使用；其定义会被保留。"
-- en: "In Manage categories, copy or replace a category’s ordered condition identifiers. Named categories and Other are exclusive destinations. Switch membership is independent."
L["In Manage categories, copy or replace a category’s ordered condition identifiers. Named categories and Other are exclusive destinations. Switch membership is independent."] = "在“管理分类”中，复制或替换某个分类中按顺序排列的条件标识符。命名分类与“其他”是互斥的目标。“切换”成员资格是独立的。"
-- en: "Filter the visible condition list by name or identifier. The category filter still applies."
L["Filter the visible condition list by name or identifier. The category filter still applies."] = "按名称或标识符筛选可见的条件列表。分类筛选仍然适用。"
-- en: "Allow this condition type to be used when automatically selecting a rotation."
L["Allow this condition type to be used when automatically selecting a rotation."] = "允许在自动选择循环时使用此条件类型。"
-- en: "Hide this condition from the Other picker category. Explicit named-category and Switch membership remain available."
L["Hide this condition from the Other picker category. Explicit named-category and Switch membership remain available."] = "在选择器的“其他”分类中隐藏此条件。显式的命名分类和“切换”成员资格仍然可用。"
-- en: "Condition order"
L["Condition order"] = "条件顺序"
-- en: "The condition ordering controls in condition settings move the selected condition to the top, up, down or to the bottom within its current category. These are separate from the Up and Down controls for category order."
L["The condition ordering controls in condition settings move the selected condition to the top, up, down or to the bottom within its current category. These are separate from the Up and Down controls for category order."] = "条件设置中的条件排序控件可将所选条件在其当前分类中移到顶部、上移、下移或移到底部。它们与分类顺序的“上移”和“下移”控件是分开的。"
-- en: "Move the selected condition to a named category or Other. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."
L["Move the selected condition to a named category or Other. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."] = "将所选条件移动到某个命名分类或“其他”。是否可用于自动切换请单独使用“切换条件”设置。"
