L["Categories"] = "分类"
-- en: "Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."
L["Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."] = "选择一个分类并搜索条件。“隐藏”会将其从选择器中移除，但不删除其定义。“切换条件”控制它能否用于自动切换循环。“移动到”会暂存一个目标分类；其“应用”按钮会确认移动。点击已分配的分类会打开分类管理。侧边栏箭头和拖动可调整条目顺序。页面上的“应用”会保存草稿；“取消”会放弃它。自定义条件可以编辑、复制或删除。"
-- en: "Choose a named category or Other, then use Apply beside the destination to stage the move. Page Apply saves all pending changes. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."
L["Choose a named category or Other, then use Apply beside the destination to stage the move. Page Apply saves all pending changes. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."] = "选择一个命名分类或“其他”，然后使用目标旁边的“应用”来暂存移动。页面上的“应用”会保存所有待处理的更改。是否可用于自动切换请单独使用“切换条件”设置。"
-- en: "Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Cancel discards them. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."
L["Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Cancel discards them. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."] = "选择一个物品组并编辑其优先级列表。“全局”会在所有配置文件间共享该物品组。移动箭头可更改物品优先级。“绑定物品组”会拾取一件可用物品以放置到动作条上；解绑时，绑定标签会在非战斗状态下移除动作条上匹配的已绑定动作。“重置”会恢复内置的物品组。在引用字段中搜索或拖入物品。“应用”会保存设置；“取消”会放弃它们。绑定的更改是显式的动作条操作。"
