-- en: "Select a profile in the sidebar to inspect it, then Activate profile to switch. New and Duplicate open a named draft with Apply and Cancel. Import stages a validated new profile; Compare shows setting differences. Copy and Reset replace the active profile after confirmation; the red trash deletes an inactive profile."
L["Select a profile in the sidebar to inspect it, then Activate profile to switch. New and Duplicate open a named draft with Apply and Cancel. Import stages a validated new profile; Compare shows setting differences. Copy and Reset replace the active profile after confirmation; the red trash deletes an inactive profile."] = "在侧边栏中选择一个配置文件以查看，然后点击“激活配置文件”进行切换。“新建”和“复制”会打开一个带有“应用”和“取消”的命名草稿。“导入”会暂存一个经过验证的新配置文件；“比较”会显示设置差异。“从配置文件复制”和“重置”在确认后会替换当前激活的配置文件；红色垃圾桶会删除一个未激活的配置文件。"
-- en: "Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Import stages a validated replacement."
L["Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Import stages a validated replacement."] = "选择一个效果以编辑其名称、类型及该类型特有的设置。图标会实时预览效果。序列部分按顺序编辑动画、颜色、脉冲或自定义帧。“复制”会创建一个独立的效果。拖动序列卡片的表面可重新排序；字段仍可编辑。新效果可以在命名前先进行配置。“应用”会保存草稿；“取消”会放弃它。“导入”会暂存一个经过验证的替换项。"
