L["Function tabs edit separate callbacks. Changes stay in a draft. Check syntax compiles every callback without running it. Apply registers the callbacks and can run registration code. Cancel discards the draft. Undo and Redo work across function tabs."] = "各函数标签页分别编辑不同的回调。更改会保存在草稿中。“检查语法”会编译每个回调但不运行它们。“应用”会注册这些回调，并可能运行注册代码。“取消”会放弃草稿。撤销和重做可跨函数标签页使用。"
