L["Edit the description, tags, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."] = "编辑描述、标签、作者、服务器、电子邮件、网站和版本。来源引用与你的署名分开保存。“使用更改”会更新循环草稿；应用循环以保存。“取消”或 Esc 键会恢复此对话框打开时的值。"
