L["Edit the description, tags, switch priority, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."] = "编辑描述、标签、切换优先级、作者、服务器、电子邮件、网站和版本。来源引用与你的署名分开保存。“使用更改”会更新循环草稿；应用循环以保存。“取消”或 Esc 键会恢复此对话框打开时的值。"
-- en: "Higher priority wins within custom or Built In rotations. Custom rotations and a valid saved fallback take precedence over Built In rotations. Equal priorities use name, then identity. Blank means zero."
L["Higher priority wins within custom or Built In rotations. Custom rotations and a valid saved fallback take precedence over Built In rotations. Equal priorities use name, then identity. Blank means zero."] = "在自定义循环或内置循环内部，优先级较高者胜出。自定义循环和有效的已保存后备循环优先于内置循环。优先级相同时依次按名称、标识排序。留空表示零。"
