-- en: "For a numeric spell selection, also recognize auras with the same readable localized spell name. Exact IDs remain the default. Spell names already match by name. Unavailable metadata or restricted aura identity stays unavailable, including under NOT. Different spells sharing a name can match; use exact IDs when that distinction matters."
L["For a numeric spell selection, also recognize auras with the same readable localized spell name. Exact IDs remain the default. Spell names already match by name. Unavailable metadata or restricted aura identity stays unavailable, including under NOT. Different spells sharing a name can match; use exact IDs when that distinction matters."] = "对于以数字指定的法术，也识别具有相同可读本地化法术名称的光环。默认仍为精确 ID。按名称指定的法术本来就按名称匹配。不可用的元数据或受限的光环身份保持为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。同名的不同法术可能会匹配；当这种区别很重要时，请使用精确 ID。"
