L["Talent tree selects the Classic tree whose spent points are compared. Public points are read again on the next evaluation; missing or restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."] = "“天赋树”选择要比较已投入点数的经典版天赋树。公开点数会在下一次评估时重新读取；缺失或受限的点数为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。不支持网格天赋和特质树。"
