L["LuaWorkbench supplies editing, completion, API knowledge and debugging. Debug runs this buffer explicitly using the test arguments. It does not replace the saved rotation or live callback."] = "LuaWorkbench 提供编辑、自动补全、API 知识和调试功能。“调试”会使用测试参数显式运行此缓冲区。它不会取代已保存的循环或实际运行中的回调。"
