L["Function dependency bundle"] = "函数依赖包"
-- en: "Review the complete bundle before applying an import. Imported Lua can execute when registered; only apply code you trust."
L["Review the complete bundle before applying an import. Imported Lua can execute when registered; only apply code you trust."] = "应用导入前请检查完整的依赖包。导入的 Lua 在注册时可能会执行；只应用你信任的代码。"
-- en: "Review each original name, destination and dependency below. Apply import saves the complete reviewed bundle."
L["Review each original name, destination and dependency below. Apply import saves the complete reviewed bundle."] = "检查下方每个原始名称、目标和依赖项。“应用导入”会保存经过检查的完整依赖包。"
-- en: "Conflict action"
L["Conflict action"] = "冲突处理方式"
-- en: "Imported name"
