L["Paste a bundle above, then review its original names, destinations and required functions."] = "在上方粘贴一个依赖包，然后检查其原始名称、目标和所需函数。"
-- en: "Filter Built In or Custom helpers and search their names, identifiers or descriptions. Packaged helpers show read-only source and typed documentation. Duplicate creates an editable copy with a new stable identifier. Argument and return rows document the Lua signature."
L["Filter Built In or Custom helpers and search their names, identifiers or descriptions. Packaged helpers show read-only source and typed documentation. Duplicate creates an editable copy with a new stable identifier. Argument and return rows document the Lua signature."] = "筛选内置或自定义辅助函数，并搜索其名称、标识符或描述。内置辅助函数显示只读源码和带类型的文档。“复制”会创建一个带有新的稳定标识符的可编辑副本。参数行和返回值行记录了 Lua 函数签名。"
-- en: "Undo and Redo edit the Lua body. Reset restores the saved body or new-function template and can be undone. Check syntax executes no custom Lua. Apply saves the body and metadata together; Discard abandons the draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel."
L["Undo and Redo edit the Lua body. Reset restores the saved body or new-function template and can be undone. Check syntax executes no custom Lua. Apply saves the body and metadata together; Discard abandons the draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel."] = "撤销和重做编辑 Lua 函数体。“重置”会恢复已保存的函数体或新函数模板，且可以撤销。“检查语法”不执行任何自定义 Lua。“应用”会同时保存函数体和元数据；“放弃”会丢弃草稿。有更改时离开会提供“应用”“放弃”或“取消”。"
-- en: "Expand Function bindings to add explicit helper aliases and choose their targets. Changing an alias does not rewrite your Lua body. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep their dependents unavailable until repaired."
L["Expand Function bindings to add explicit helper aliases and choose their targets. Changing an alias does not rewrite your Lua body. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep their dependents unavailable until repaired."] = "展开“函数绑定”可添加显式的辅助函数别名并选择其目标。更改别名不会重写你的 Lua 函数体。缺失、已禁用或无效的依赖项会使依赖它们的项目在修复前保持不可用。"
-- en: "Include custom function dependencies exports their source with the selected definition. Without it, the bundle records required helper identities and versions. Review source shows every imported Lua body. Resolve each original name and destination with Reuse, Replace or a new identifier. Apply import saves the complete reviewed bundle and can register imported Lua. Only apply code you trust."
L["Include custom function dependencies exports their source with the selected definition. Without it, the bundle records required helper identities and versions. Review source shows every imported Lua body. Resolve each original name and destination with Reuse, Replace or a new identifier. Apply import saves the complete reviewed bundle and can register imported Lua. Only apply code you trust."] = "“包含自定义函数依赖项”会将其源码与所选定义一同导出。不勾选时，依赖包只记录所需辅助函数的身份和版本。“检查源码”会显示每个导入的 Lua 函数体。对每个原始名称和目标，选择“复用”“替换”或使用新标识符。“应用导入”会保存经过检查的完整依赖包，并可能注册导入的 Lua。只应用你信任的代码。"
-- en: "Check"
L["Check"] = "检查"
-- en: "Live"
L["Live"] = "实时"
-- en: "Preview"
L["Preview"] = "预览"
-- en: "The preview failed. Use /rm errors for details."
L["The preview failed. Use /rm errors for details."] = "预览失败。详情请使用 /rm errors。"
-- en: "Test values were not saved because they are not bounded plain data."
L["Test values were not saved because they are not bounded plain data."] = "测试值未保存，因为它们不是有限的纯数据。"
-- en: "Condition check"
L["Condition check"] = "条件检查"
-- en: "Fields UI preview"
L["Fields UI preview"] = "字段界面预览"
-- en: "Help preview"
L["Help preview"] = "帮助预览"
-- en: "Edit detached test values below. Check validates them before evaluating. Live is opt-in; test values are saved separately from the condition source."
L["Edit detached test values below. Check validates them before evaluating. Live is opt-in; test values are saved separately from the condition source."] = "在下方编辑独立的测试值。“检查”会先验证再评估。“实时”需手动开启；测试值与条件源码分开保存。"
-- en: "Preview runs only this callback with detached sample values. It does not save or register the condition."
L["Preview runs only this callback with detached sample values. It does not save or register the condition."] = "预览只会使用独立的示例值运行此回调。它不会保存或注册条件。"
-- en: "Complete the source fields before checking."
L["Complete the source fields before checking."] = "检查前请先完成源码字段。"
-- en: "Check could not compile the current source. Fix the source before checking again."
L["Check could not compile the current source. Fix the source before checking again."] = "“检查”无法编译当前源码。请修复源码后再检查。"
-- en: "Skipped: invalid test values"
L["Skipped: invalid test values"] = "已跳过：测试值无效"
-- en: "Validation: %s"
L["Validation: %s"] = "验证：%s"
-- en: "Passed"
L["Passed"] = "通过"
-- en: "Evaluation: %s"
L["Evaluation: %s"] = "评估：%s"
-- en: "Fields UI and Help offer an explicit Preview of the current callback. Preview uses detached sample values and the normal field or help renderer. It does not save, register, validate or evaluate the condition. Closing it releases its controls and returns to the source draft. Check syntax never runs a callback."
L["Fields UI and Help offer an explicit Preview of the current callback. Preview uses detached sample values and the normal field or help renderer. It does not save, register, validate or evaluate the condition. Closing it releases its controls and returns to the source draft. Check syntax never runs a callback."] = "“字段界面”和“帮助”提供当前回调的显式“预览”。预览使用独立的示例值以及正常的字段或帮助渲染器。它不会保存、注册、验证或评估条件。关闭后会释放其控件并返回源码草稿。“检查语法”从不运行回调。"
-- en: "Evaluate and Validate offer Check with the same Fields UI and detached sample values. Check runs validation first, then evaluates only valid values. Results show true, false or an unavailable reason. Live is opt-in and checks at most twice per second while this panel is shown; closing stops it. Test values are saved separately and never enter condition exports or rotation edits. Source changes run no callbacks unless you check again or enable Live."
L["Evaluate and Validate offer Check with the same Fields UI and detached sample values. Check runs validation first, then evaluates only valid values. Results show true, false or an unavailable reason. Live is opt-in and checks at most twice per second while this panel is shown; closing stops it. Test values are saved separately and never enter condition exports or rotation edits. Source changes run no callbacks unless you check again or enable Live."] = "“评估”和“验证”提供“检查”，使用相同的字段界面和独立的示例值。“检查”会先进行验证，然后只评估有效的值。结果显示为真、假或不可用的原因。“实时”需手动开启，在此面板显示期间每秒最多检查两次；关闭面板即停止。测试值单独保存，永远不会进入条件导出或循环编辑。除非你再次检查或启用“实时”，否则源码更改不会运行任何回调。"
-- en: "Functions reference"
L["Functions reference"] = "函数参考"
-- en: "The Functions page documents public helpers and their typed arguments, return values and source. Context completion and hover use that reference; Ctrl-click a known helper to open its source. Use explicit binding aliases for reusable custom helpers."
L["The Functions page documents public helpers and their typed arguments, return values and source. Context completion and hover use that reference; Ctrl-click a known helper to open its source. Use explicit binding aliases for reusable custom helpers."] = "“函数”页面记录了公共辅助函数及其带类型的参数、返回值和源码。上下文补全和悬停提示会使用这些参考；按住 Ctrl 点击已知的辅助函数可打开其源码。对可复用的自定义辅助函数，请使用显式的绑定别名。"
-- en: "The imported definition type does not match this editor."
L["The imported definition type does not match this editor."] = "导入的定义类型与此编辑器不匹配。"
-- en: "Test values changed. Check again to refresh the result."
L["Test values changed. Check again to refresh the result."] = "测试值已更改。请再次检查以刷新结果。"
-- en: "Complete the highlighted test inputs before checking."
L["Complete the highlighted test inputs before checking."] = "检查前请先完成高亮标出的测试输入。"
-- en: "Test"
L["Test"] = "测试"
-- en: "Run test"
L["Run test"] = "运行测试"
-- en: "Test condition"
L["Test condition"] = "测试条件"
-- en: "Debugger output"
L["Debugger output"] = "调试器输出"
-- en: "Set test values in Test before debugging Evaluate."
L["Set test values in Test before debugging Evaluate."] = "调试“评估”前，请先在“测试”中设置测试值。"
-- en: "Debugger output uses a detached sample and the normal field or help container."
L["Debugger output uses a detached sample and the normal field or help container."] = "调试器输出使用独立的示例以及正常的字段或帮助容器。"
-- en: "Choose test values in Fields UI, then Run test to validate and evaluate. Help is shown below the fields. Opening Test does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in."
L["Choose test values in Fields UI, then Run test to validate and evaluate. Help is shown below the fields. Opening Test does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in."] = "在字段界面中选择测试值，然后点击“运行测试”进行验证和评估。帮助显示在字段下方。打开“测试”不会评估默认值。“实时”需手动开启。"
-- en: "Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Choose the fields and Run test to validate, then evaluate only valid values. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."
L["Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Choose the fields and Run test to validate, then evaluate only valid values. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."] = "“测试”会从任一回调标签页打开一个条件级对话框。它会结合独立的测试值同时渲染字段界面和帮助。选择字段并点击“运行测试”进行验证，然后只评估有效的值。打开对话框不会评估默认值。“实时”需手动开启，并在对话框关闭时停止。已提交的测试值可供调试器使用，并与源码、导出内容和循环编辑相互独立。“检查语法”从不运行回调。"
