L["Source helper"] = "源辅助函数"
-- en: "Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. Names suggest the local binding used to call them; registry identifiers stay stable."
L["Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. Names suggest the local binding used to call them; registry identifiers stay stable."] = "函数名称使用字母、数字和下划线，并以字母或下划线开头。名称会作为调用它们时所用本地绑定的建议；注册表标识符保持稳定。"
