L["This cannot be undone."] = "此操作无法撤销。"
-- en: "Delete this announcement?"
L["Delete this announcement?"] = "删除此通报？"
-- en: "Type: %s"
L["Type: %s"] = "类型：%s"
-- en: "Supported unit-token to localized unit-name lookup. Use value.unit as a key; for example addon.units[value.unit]. Available tokens vary by client."
L["Supported unit-token to localized unit-name lookup. Use value.unit as a key; for example addon.units[value.unit]. Available tokens vary by client."] = "受支持的单位标识到本地化单位名称的查找表。以 value.unit 作为键；例如 addon.units[value.unit]。可用的标识因客户端而异。"
-- en: "Supported unit-token to localized possessive unit-name lookup, such as your target."
L["Supported unit-token to localized possessive unit-name lookup, such as your target."] = "受支持的单位标识到本地化所有格单位名称（例如“你的目标的”）的查找表。"
-- en: "Rotation Master client compatibility adapter. Its methods return ordinary readable results or nil with a reason when an observation is unavailable. Use a colon call, or pass addon.Platform explicitly as self with a dot reference."
L["Rotation Master client compatibility adapter. Its methods return ordinary readable results or nil with a reason when an observation is unavailable. Use a colon call, or pass addon.Platform explicitly as self with a dot reference."] = "Rotation Master 客户端兼容性适配器。其方法返回普通的可读结果；当观测不可用时返回 nil 及原因。请使用冒号调用，或在点号引用时显式将 addon.Platform 作为 self 传入。"
-- en: "Rotation Master spell catalog for resolving client-specific spell IDs, ranks, names, icons and links."
L["Rotation Master spell catalog for resolving client-specific spell IDs, ranks, names, icons and links."] = "Rotation Master 法术目录，用于解析因客户端而异的法术 ID、等级、名称、图标和链接。"
-- en: "Utility functions explicitly bound to this condition or function. Choose a completion to bind an available custom function before inserting its reference."
L["Utility functions explicitly bound to this condition or function. Choose a completion to bind an available custom function before inserting its reference."] = "显式绑定到此条件或函数的工具函数。在插入其引用前，选择一个补全项以绑定可用的自定义函数。"
-- en: "Rotation Master custom function"
L["Rotation Master custom function"] = "Rotation Master 自定义函数"
-- en: "Rotation Master built-in function"
L["Rotation Master built-in function"] = "Rotation Master 内置函数"
-- en: "Rotation Master value"
L["Rotation Master value"] = "Rotation Master 值"
-- en: "Global function (documentation unavailable on this client)"
L["Global function (documentation unavailable on this client)"] = "全局函数（此客户端上没有文档）"
-- en: "This client does not provide signature documentation for this function. No arguments or return types have been inferred."
L["This client does not provide signature documentation for this function. No arguments or return types have been inferred."] = "此客户端未提供此函数的签名文档。未推断任何参数或返回类型。"
-- en: "Invoke"
L["Invoke"] = "调用"
-- en: "Functions are shared across profiles after Apply. Call custom utilities as functions.name(...); accepting completion adds the dependency binding. Typed calls need a binding under Function bindings. Built In examples show dot or colon explicitly."
L["Functions are shared across profiles after Apply. Call custom utilities as functions.name(...); accepting completion adds the dependency binding. Typed calls need a binding under Function bindings. Built In examples show dot or colon explicitly."] = "函数在应用后会在所有配置文件间共享。以 functions.name(...) 调用自定义工具函数；接受自动补全会添加依赖绑定。带类型的调用需要在“函数绑定”下有一个绑定。内置示例会显式使用点号或冒号。"
-- en: "Show line numbers"
L["Show line numbers"] = "显示行号"
-- en: "Line-number visibility applies to every condition and function code editor."
L["Line-number visibility applies to every condition and function code editor."] = "行号显示设置适用于每个条件和函数的代码编辑器。"
-- en: "Call a saved custom utility as functions.name(...). Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, choose its helper under Function bindings. Existing direct aliases still work. The Invoke example shows required addon dot or colon syntax for Built In functions. Renaming an alias does not rewrite source. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."
L["Call a saved custom utility as functions.name(...). Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, choose its helper under Function bindings. Existing direct aliases still work. The Invoke example shows required addon dot or colon syntax for Built In functions. Renaming an alias does not rewrite source. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."] = "以 functions.name(...) 调用已保存的自定义工具函数。接受自动补全会附加其稳定的依赖绑定；对于带类型的调用，请在“函数绑定”下选择其辅助函数。现有的直接别名仍可使用。“调用”示例展示了内置函数所需的 addon 点号或冒号语法。重命名别名不会重写源码。缺失、已禁用或无效的依赖项会使使用它们的项目保持不可用。"
-- en: "Choose the editor for custom Lua conditions and functions. Show line numbers applies across code editors. Built In syntax highlighting and Plain text work without another addon. Automatic selects a connected provider or falls back safely. Apply saves settings; editor changes take effect on reopening, and line-number visibility updates open editors. LuaWorkbench and WowLua loading status is shown separately from integration availability."
L["Choose the editor for custom Lua conditions and functions. Show line numbers applies across code editors. Built In syntax highlighting and Plain text work without another addon. Automatic selects a connected provider or falls back safely. Apply saves settings; editor changes take effect on reopening, and line-number visibility updates open editors. LuaWorkbench and WowLua loading status is shown separately from integration availability."] = "选择自定义 Lua 条件和函数所用的编辑器。“显示行号”适用于所有代码编辑器。“内置语法高亮”和“纯文本”无需其他插件即可使用。“自动”会选择一个已连接的提供者，或安全地回退。“应用”会保存设置；编辑器的更改在重新打开时生效，行号显示会更新已打开的编辑器。LuaWorkbench 和 WowLua 的加载状态与集成可用性分开显示。"
-- en: "All namespaces"
L["All namespaces"] = "所有命名空间"
-- en: "Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self: the Invoke example includes a method receiver explicitly, and Existing API preserves its original dot or colon spelling. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."
L["Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self: the Invoke example includes a method receiver explicitly, and Existing API preserves its original dot or colon spelling. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."] = "以 namespace.name(...) 调用工具函数。内置命名空间与源文件对应；自定义函数自行选择其命名空间。接受自动补全会附加其稳定的依赖绑定；对于带类型的调用，请在“函数绑定”下添加其完整限定名。命名空间不提供 self：“调用”示例会显式包含方法接收者，“现有 API”保留其原有的点号或冒号写法。现有别名仍可使用。重命名函数或命名空间不会重写现有代码或绑定。缺失、已禁用或无效的依赖项会使使用它们的项目保持不可用。"
-- en: "Choose a source helper and its name in this Lua body, such as custom.ready or utils.getCached. Namespaces are private to this callback. Renaming a binding does not rewrite code."
L["Choose a source helper and its name in this Lua body, such as custom.ready or utils.getCached. Namespaces are private to this callback. Renaming a binding does not rewrite code."] = "在此 Lua 函数体中选择一个源辅助函数及其名称，例如 custom.ready 或 utils.getCached。命名空间是此回调私有的。重命名绑定不会重写代码。"
-- en: "Debug current buffer"
L["Debug current buffer"] = "调试当前缓冲区"
-- en: "Debugger terminal"
L["Debugger terminal"] = "调试器终端"
-- en: "Existing API"
L["Existing API"] = "现有 API"
-- en: "Name in code"
L["Name in code"] = "代码中的名称"
-- en: "Namespace"
L["Namespace"] = "命名空间"
-- en: "Namespaces group functions; they do not supply a receiver. Accept a completion to bind the shown dotted call. For a typed call, add the same qualified name under Function bindings. Method examples include the required receiver explicitly. Functions are shared across profiles after Apply."
L["Namespaces group functions; they do not supply a receiver. Accept a completion to bind the shown dotted call. For a typed call, add the same qualified name under Function bindings. Method examples include the required receiver explicitly. Functions are shared across profiles after Apply."] = "命名空间用于对函数分组；它们不提供接收者。接受自动补全即可绑定所显示的点号调用。对于带类型的调用，请在“函数绑定”下添加相同的完整限定名。方法示例会显式包含所需的接收者。函数在应用后会在所有配置文件间共享。"
-- en: "Play runs the current buffer once without debugging. Condition callbacks use the fields configured in Test; functions use Test arguments. Returns, printed output and full errors are available in Output. Running does not apply source changes or replace the live callback."
L["Play runs the current buffer once without debugging. Condition callbacks use the fields configured in Test; functions use Test arguments. Returns, printed output and full errors are available in Output. Running does not apply source changes or replace the live callback."] = "“播放”会在不调试的情况下运行一次当前缓冲区。条件回调使用在“测试”中配置的字段；函数使用测试参数。返回值、打印输出和完整错误可在“输出”中查看。运行不会应用源码更改，也不会替换实际运行中的回调。"
-- en: "Private utility-function namespace. It contains only explicit bindings for this callback."
L["Private utility-function namespace. It contains only explicit bindings for this callback."] = "私有的工具函数命名空间。它只包含此回调的显式绑定。"
-- en: "Run current buffer"
L["Run current buffer"] = "运行当前缓冲区"
-- en: "The Debug button starts a separate session and pauses at the first executable line or breakpoint. Continue resumes execution, Step over advances past the current operation, and Step into enters instrumented script functions. Native functions cannot be stepped into. Stop ends the session. F5 continues, F10 steps over, F11 steps into, and Shift+F5 stops."
L["The Debug button starts a separate session and pauses at the first executable line or breakpoint. Continue resumes execution, Step over advances past the current operation, and Step into enters instrumented script functions. Native functions cannot be stepped into. Stop ends the session. F5 continues, F10 steps over, F11 steps into, and Shift+F5 stops."] = "“调试”按钮会启动一个单独的会话，并在第一个可执行行或断点处暂停。“继续”会恢复执行，“单步跳过”会越过当前操作，“单步进入”会进入已插桩的脚本函数。无法单步进入原生函数。“停止”会结束会话。F5 继续，F10 单步跳过，F11 单步进入，Shift+F5 停止。"
-- en: "The debugger terminal appears below the code while debugging. When paused, enter expressions or assignments to inspect or change the current variables. The drawer button hides or shows the terminal. Output provides a copyable report of printed output, terminal evaluations and complete errors."
L["The debugger terminal appears below the code while debugging. When paused, enter expressions or assignments to inspect or change the current variables. The drawer button hides or shows the terminal. Output provides a copyable report of printed output, terminal evaluations and complete errors."] = "调试时，调试器终端会显示在代码下方。暂停时，可输入表达式或赋值语句来检查或更改当前变量。抽屉按钮可隐藏或显示终端。“输出”提供一份可复制的报告，包含打印输出、终端求值结果和完整错误。"
-- en: "Argument"
L["Argument"] = "参数"
-- en: "Arguments and returns"
L["Arguments and returns"] = "参数和返回值"
-- en: "Bindings (%d)"
L["Bindings (%d)"] = "绑定（%d）"
-- en: "Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self. Pass a method receiver explicitly in a namespaced dot call; object:method(x) is Lua shorthand for object.method(object, x). Existing addon APIs remain compatible with saved definitions. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."
L["Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self. Pass a method receiver explicitly in a namespaced dot call; object:method(x) is Lua shorthand for object.method(object, x). Existing addon APIs remain compatible with saved definitions. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."] = "以 namespace.name(...) 调用工具函数。内置命名空间与源文件对应；自定义函数自行选择其命名空间。接受自动补全会附加其稳定的依赖绑定；对于带类型的调用，请在“函数绑定”下添加其完整限定名。命名空间不提供 self。在命名空间的点号调用中请显式传入方法接收者；object:method(x) 是 Lua 中 object.method(object, x) 的简写。现有插件 API 与已保存的定义保持兼容。现有别名仍可使用。重命名函数或命名空间不会重写现有代码或绑定。缺失、已禁用或无效的依赖项会使使用它们的项目保持不可用。"
-- en: "Changing argument or return order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"
L["Changing argument or return order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"] = "更改参数或返回值的顺序可能会破坏现有的调用方。Rotation Master 不会重写它们的 Lua 代码。是否继续？"
-- en: "Choose an existing namespace from the suggestions or type a new dotted namespace. Built In namespaces follow source files; custom namespaces are implied by saved functions and need no separate maintenance."
L["Choose an existing namespace from the suggestions or type a new dotted namespace. Built In namespaces follow source files; custom namespaces are implied by saved functions and need no separate maintenance."] = "从建议中选择一个现有的命名空间，或输入一个新的点分命名空间。内置命名空间与源文件对应；自定义命名空间由已保存的函数隐含产生，无需单独维护。"
-- en: "Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."
L["Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."] = "点击“参数”或“返回值”标题可将其折叠或展开。“+ 参数”和“+ 返回值”在点击时追加到末尾，拖动时则插入到高亮显示的空隙。拖动某一行或使用“上移 / 下移”来重新排序；按住 Ctrl 拖动会带上后续的行。垃圾桶会移除一行。“类型”和“可为空”记录可接受的值；“描述”说明每个输入或结果。Lua 可以按顺序返回多个结果。对已保存的函数重新排序时会发出警告，因为按位置调用的调用方可能需要修改；RM 不会重写调用处。"
-- en: "Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. The code signature shows the qualified namespace.name used by callers."
L["Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. The code signature shows the qualified namespace.name used by callers."] = "函数名称使用字母、数字和下划线，并以字母或下划线开头。代码签名会显示调用方使用的完整限定名 namespace.name。"
-- en: "Return"
L["Return"] = "返回值"
-- en: "Search helpers by name or description, then filter Built In / Custom and namespace. Packaged helpers use the same read-only pane. Duplicate creates an editable custom copy."
L["Search helpers by name or description, then filter Built In / Custom and namespace. Packaged helpers use the same read-only pane. Duplicate creates an editable custom copy."] = "按名称或描述搜索辅助函数，然后按“内置 / 自定义”和命名空间筛选。内置辅助函数使用相同的只读面板。“复制”会创建一个可编辑的自定义副本。"
-- en: "Changing argument order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"
L["Changing argument order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"] = "更改参数顺序可能会破坏现有的调用方。Rotation Master 不会重写它们的 Lua 代码。是否继续？"
-- en: "Changing return documentation order does not rewrite return statements or existing callers. Review the Lua body and callers for the new order. Continue?"
L["Changing return documentation order does not rewrite return statements or existing callers. Review the Lua body and callers for the new order. Continue?"] = "更改返回值文档的顺序不会重写 return 语句或现有的调用方。请按新的顺序检查 Lua 函数体和调用方。是否继续？"
-- en: "Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Return rows describe those results; moving them does not rewrite return statements. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."
L["Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Return rows describe those results; moving them does not rewrite return statements. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."] = "点击“参数”或“返回值”标题可将其折叠或展开。“+ 参数”和“+ 返回值”在点击时追加到末尾，拖动时则插入到高亮显示的空隙。拖动某一行或使用“上移 / 下移”来重新排序；按住 Ctrl 拖动会带上后续的行。垃圾桶会移除一行。“类型”和“可为空”记录可接受的值；“描述”说明每个输入或结果。Lua 可以按顺序返回多个结果。返回值行描述这些结果；移动它们不会重写 return 语句。对已保存的函数重新排序时会发出警告，因为按位置调用的调用方可能需要修改；RM 不会重写调用处。"
-- en: "Card controls"
L["Card controls"] = "卡片控件"
-- en: "Describe this value for function documentation, completion and hover help. Changes remain in the draft until Apply."
L["Describe this value for function documentation, completion and hover help. Changes remain in the draft until Apply."] = "描述此值，用于函数文档、自动补全和悬停帮助。更改会保留在草稿中，直到点击“应用”。"
-- en: "Drag a card to reorder arguments; Ctrl-drag includes following arguments. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the argument with a unique name; the trash can removes it. Reordering a saved function requires confirmation because existing callers are not rewritten."
L["Drag a card to reorder arguments; Ctrl-drag includes following arguments. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the argument with a unique name; the trash can removes it. Reordering a saved function requires confirmation because existing callers are not rewritten."] = "拖动卡片可重新排列参数；按住 Ctrl 拖动会包括后续参数。上下箭头每次移动一个位置。“复制”会以唯一的名称复制参数；垃圾桶会移除它。对已保存的函数重新排序需要确认，因为现有的调用方不会被重写。"
-- en: "Drag a card to reorder return documentation; Ctrl-drag includes following returns. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the documented return value; the trash can removes it. Return order in this list does not rewrite return statements or callers."
L["Drag a card to reorder return documentation; Ctrl-drag includes following returns. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the documented return value; the trash can removes it. Return order in this list does not rewrite return statements or callers."] = "拖动卡片可重新排列返回值文档；按住 Ctrl 拖动会包括后续返回值。上下箭头每次移动一个位置。“复制”会复制所记录的返回值；垃圾桶会移除它。此列表中的返回值顺序不会重写 return 语句或调用方。"
-- en: "Preview rendered. Use Output for printed messages."
L["Preview rendered. Use Output for printed messages."] = "预览已渲染。打印的消息请在“输出”中查看。"
-- en: "Rendered output appears here when the callback runs or steps through widget creation."
L["Rendered output appears here when the callback runs or steps through widget creation."] = "当回调运行或单步执行控件创建时，渲染的输出会显示在这里。"
-- en: "Set values in Test before running or debugging this condition."
L["Set values in Test before running or debugging this condition."] = "运行或调试此条件前，请先在“测试”中设置数值。"
-- en: "The argument name is the local parameter available in the Lua body. Use a valid Lua identifier. Renaming this documentation does not rewrite references in the code."
L["The argument name is the local parameter available in the Lua body. Use a valid Lua identifier. Renaming this documentation does not rewrite references in the code."] = "参数名称是 Lua 函数体中可用的本地形参。请使用有效的 Lua 标识符。重命名此文档不会重写代码中的引用。"
-- en: "Type and Nullable describe the values accepted or returned by this function. They document the contract; they do not rewrite or validate values in the Lua body."
L["Type and Nullable describe the values accepted or returned by this function. They document the contract; they do not rewrite or validate values in the Lua body."] = "“类型”和“可为空”描述此函数接受或返回的值。它们记录的是约定；不会重写或验证 Lua 函数体中的值。"
-- en: "Enable Rotation Master recommendations, automatic rotation switching and bound item-set updates. Disabling clears active advice and highlights and hides the preview. Apply saves the change."
L["Help.General.enable"] = "启用 Rotation Master 的推荐、自动切换循环和已绑定物品组的更新。禁用会清除当前的建议和高亮，并隐藏预览。“应用”会保存更改。"
-- en: "Set how often Rotation Master reevaluates the active rotation and independent cooldowns, in seconds. A shorter interval updates advice more often and uses more processing time. It does not cast spells, queue actions, or predict future combat."
L["Help.General.poll"] = "设置 Rotation Master 重新评估当前循环和独立冷却的频率，单位为秒。间隔越短，建议更新越频繁，占用的处理时间也越多。它不会施放法术、排队动作或预测未来的战斗。"
-- en: "Out of combat with no target and no focus, Rotation Master skips a polling tick unless something it watches has changed: auras, cooldowns, health or power of you, your pet or party, movement, casting, equipment, bags, form, pets or group. It still re-checks at least this often, for time-based conditions (aura or cooldown remaining), distance, and custom code. In combat, with any target or focus, or while configuration is open, every polling tick is evaluated. Zero evaluates every polling tick."
L["Help.General.idle_poll"] = "在非战斗状态下且没有目标和焦点目标时，除非它所监视的内容发生变化，否则 Rotation Master 会跳过一次轮询：你、你的宠物或小队的光环、冷却、生命值或能量，移动、施法、装备、背包、形态、宠物或队伍。对于基于时间的条件（光环或冷却剩余时间）、距离和自定义代码，它仍会至少按此频率重新检查。在战斗中、有任何目标或焦点目标时，或配置界面打开时，每次轮询都会进行评估。为零时每次轮询都会评估。"
-- en: "With automatic switching, Rotation Master checks this often, in and out of combat, whether a different rotation's switch conditions now match, so conditions that change on their own (nearby enemy count, threat, movement, health) take effect. Target, focus and pet changes are checked straight away. Zero turns automatic switching off. Choosing a rotation manually still overrides automatic switching until you choose Auto again."
L["Help.General.autoswitch_poll"] = "启用自动切换时，Rotation Master 会按此频率（无论是否在战斗中）检查另一个循环的切换条件现在是否匹配，从而让那些会自行变化的条件（附近敌人数量、仇恨、移动、生命值）生效。目标、焦点目标和宠物的变化会被立即检查。为零时会关闭自动切换。手动选择循环仍会覆盖自动切换，直到你再次选择“自动”。"
-- en: "Keep Rotation Master from automatically selecting another rotation from its switch condition. This preference survives reloads. Manually choosing a rotation with /rm set <rotation> also suspends automatic switching until you choose automatic selection again."
L["Help.General.disable_autoswitch"] = "阻止 Rotation Master 根据切换条件自动选择其他循环。此偏好在重载后保留。使用 /rm set <rotation> 手动选择循环也会暂停自动切换，直到你再次选择自动选择。"
-- en: "Hide the main rotation recommendation on action bars. Independent cooldown highlights remain available. Enable Preview Spells if you want to see the main advice in a separate window; with both displays off, the main recommendation has no visible icon."
L["Help.General.disable_buttons"] = "隐藏动作条上的主循环推荐。独立的冷却高亮仍然可用。若想在单独的窗口中查看主要建议，请启用“预览法术”；如果两种显示都关闭，主推荐将没有可见的图标。"
-- en: "Set the refresh interval for condition status while editing, in seconds. Zero turns off periodic status updates. This is separate from the recommendation polling interval and does not enable live condition testing unless you explicitly choose it."
L["Help.General.live_config_update"] = "设置编辑时条件状态的刷新间隔，单位为秒。为零时关闭定期状态更新。这与推荐的轮询间隔分开，除非你明确选择，否则不会启用实时条件测试。"
-- en: "Show the Rotation Master minimap icon. Left-click toggles the configuration window. Right-click opens the quick menu for enabling recommendations and choosing a rotation or automatic switching."
L["Help.General.minimap"] = "显示 Rotation Master 小地图图标。左键点击可开关配置窗口。右键点击可打开快捷菜单，用于启用推荐以及选择循环或自动切换。"
-- en: "Choose Diagram or List as the starting rotation view. This profile preference applies when opening a rotation; changing the view inside the editor does not change this setting. Cooldowns always use a scrolling grid."
L["Help.General.rotation_view"] = "选择“图表”或“列表”作为初始的循环视图。此配置文件偏好会在打开循环时生效；在编辑器内更改视图不会改变此设置。冷却总是使用可滚动的网格。"
-- en: "Choose how many seconds of previous spell casts to retain for history-based conditions. Older casts are removed as recommendations update. A longer history retains more records."
L["Help.General.spell_history"] = "选择为基于历史的条件保留多少秒的过往施法记录。较早的施法会在推荐更新时被移除。历史越长，保留的记录越多。"
-- en: "Choose how many seconds of combat events to retain for conditions such as recent hits, parries and blocks. Older events are removed as recommendations update. Availability depends on the client combat-data policy."
L["Help.General.combat_history"] = "选择为“最近被命中、招架和格挡”等条件保留多少秒的战斗事件。较早的事件会在推荐更新时被移除。可用性取决于客户端的战斗数据策略。"
-- en: "Choose how many seconds of observed damage and healing to retain for burn-rate and time-to-die estimates. Recent observations receive more weight. A longer window uses more records and smooths short changes; it cannot supply events the client does not expose."
L["Help.General.damage_history"] = "选择保留多少秒观测到的伤害和治疗，用于计算消耗速率和死亡时间估算。较新的观测权重更高。时间窗口越长，使用的记录越多，短期波动越平滑；但它无法提供客户端未公开的事件。"
-- en: "Choose a whole number of upcoming recommendations, from zero (hidden) to five. The preview shows current priority results, not a simulation of future cooldowns or combat. Icons start at 64 pixels; resizing scales all icons while preserving their square shape and the window ratio."
L["Help.General.preview_spells"] = "选择要显示的后续推荐数量（整数），从零（隐藏）到五。预览显示的是当前优先级的结果，而不是对未来冷却或战斗的模拟。图标初始为 64 像素；调整大小会缩放所有图标，同时保持其正方形外观和窗口比例。"
-- en: "Adjust the preview background and title bar opacity without fading its icons. At zero only the icons remain, and the hidden frame does not intercept blank-space clicks. Restore opacity in General to access the title bar and resize handle."
L["Help.General.preview_opacity"] = "调整预览背景和标题栏的不透明度，而不会淡化其图标。为零时只保留图标，隐藏的框体不会拦截空白处的点击。要使用标题栏和调整大小的控点，请在“常规”中恢复不透明度。"
-- en: "Prevent moving the preview by its title bar or resizing it by its lower-right corner. Locking and unlocking take effect immediately and are saved without Apply. Other pending General edits remain unchanged."
L["Help.General.preview_locked"] = "防止通过标题栏移动预览，或通过右下角调整其大小。锁定和解锁会立即生效，并且无需“应用”即可保存。其他待处理的常规编辑保持不变。"
-- en: "Arrange preview icons horizontally (default) or vertically. Lock, Direction and Reset share one row below the opacity slider. Changing direction keeps icons square and adjusts the window ratio."
L["Help.General.preview_vertical"] = "将预览图标水平（默认）或垂直排列。“锁定”“方向”和“重置”位于不透明度滑块下方的同一行。更改方向会保持图标为正方形并调整窗口比例。"
-- en: "Immediately return the preview window to the screen center and restore 64-pixel icons without Apply. Other pending settings are preserved."
L["Help.General.preview_reset"] = "立即将预览窗口移回屏幕中央，并恢复 64 像素的图标，无需点击“应用”。其他待处理的设置会被保留。"
-- en: "This icon previews the selected profile effect, color, size, anchor and offsets. Previewing an effect does not save the draft or change the spell being recommended."
L["Help.General.preview"] = "此图标会预览所选配置文件的效果、颜色、大小、锚点和偏移。预览效果不会保存草稿，也不会改变正在推荐的法术。"
-- en: "Choose the highlight used for the main recommendation and as the default for independent cooldowns. Manage available effects on the Effects page. A cooldown can override these profile settings in its action details."
L["Help.General.effect"] = "选择用于主推荐的高亮效果，它同时也是独立冷却的默认效果。在“效果”页面管理可用的效果。冷却可以在其动作详情中覆盖这些配置文件设置。"
-- en: "Scale the highlight relative to its action icon. A value of 1 uses the icon size. Drag the slider or type its numeric value; the preview updates as you edit."
L["Help.General.magnification"] = "相对于动作图标缩放高亮。值为 1 时使用图标大小。拖动滑块或输入数值；预览会随编辑实时更新。"
-- en: "Choose the highlight color and opacity. Click the color swatch to open the picker, or enter R, G, B and A values between 0 and 1. Alpha controls opacity; individual cooldowns may override this profile color."
L["Help.General.color"] = "选择高亮的颜色和不透明度。点击色块可打开取色器，或输入 0 到 1 之间的 R、G、B 和 A 值。Alpha 控制不透明度；单个冷却可以覆盖此配置文件颜色。"
-- en: "Choose the point on the action icon where a texture highlight is anchored by its center. Changing Anchor resets the offsets. The preview shows the resulting placement; non-texture glows may use offsets without a texture anchor."
L["Help.General.setpoint"] = "选择材质高亮以其中心锚定在动作图标上的哪个点。更改锚点会重置偏移。预览会显示最终的位置；非材质类发光效果可能在没有材质锚点的情况下使用偏移。"
-- en: "Vertical offset in pixels. Use Up or Down on the position control, or edit V directly. Hold Shift while using an arrow for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets and the anchor to Center."
L["Help.General.yoffs"] = "以像素为单位的垂直偏移。使用位置控件上的“上”或“下”，或直接编辑“纵”。使用箭头时按住 Shift 每次移动十像素。“居中”会将两个偏移和锚点重置为居中。"
-- en: "Horizontal offset in pixels. Use Left or Right on the position control, or edit H directly. Hold Shift while using an arrow for ten pixels. Non-texture glows interpret offsets according to their effect shape."
L["Help.General.xoffs"] = "以像素为单位的水平偏移。使用位置控件上的“左”或“右”，或直接编辑“横”。使用箭头时按住 Shift 每次移动十像素。非材质类发光效果会根据其效果形状来解释偏移。"
-- en: "Choose the display name for your primary specialization. This changes its label in Rotation Master, not your character talents or specialization."
L["Help.General.spec1"] = "选择主专精的显示名称。这只会改变它在 Rotation Master 中的标签，不会改变角色的天赋或专精。"
-- en: "Choose the display name for your secondary specialization. This changes its label in Rotation Master, not your character talents or specialization."
L["Help.General.spec2"] = "选择副专精的显示名称。这只会改变它在 Rotation Master 中的标签，不会改变角色的天赋或专精。"
-- en: "Choose the amount of Rotation Master chat output. Silent suppresses routine output. Default reports normal changes such as rotation switching. Debug adds runtime statistics and trigger information. Verbose includes detailed condition and highlight activity and can produce substantial output."
L["Help.General.loglevel"] = "选择 Rotation Master 在聊天框中的输出量。“静默”会抑制常规输出。“默认”会报告循环切换等正常变化。“调试”会增加运行时统计和触发信息。“详细”包含详细的条件和高亮活动，可能产生大量输出。"
-- en: "Include component timings in the periodic Debug or Verbose profiling report. Reports show measured runs, total, minimum, average and maximum in milliseconds. Timings include child work; nested scopes overlap and must not be added together. The overall scope starts after rotation preparation. This is elapsed timing, not the native addon CPU report."
L["Help.General.detailed_profiling"] = "在定期的调试或详细性能分析报告中包含各组件的耗时。报告以毫秒为单位显示测量次数、总计、最小值、平均值和最大值。耗时包含子任务；嵌套的范围会相互重叠，不能相加。整体范围从循环准备完成后开始计时。这是经过时间，而不是原生的插件 CPU 报告。"
-- en: "Effects define how action-bar icons are highlighted. They are shared across characters. General settings select the main recommendation effect and cooldown default; individual cooldowns can choose another effect. Select an effect in the sidebar to inspect or edit it."
L["Help.Effects.overview"] = "效果定义了动作条图标的高亮方式。效果在所有角色间共享。常规设置会选择主推荐效果和冷却的默认效果；单个冷却可以选择其他效果。在侧边栏中选择一个效果以查看或编辑。"
-- en: "Give the effect a name used by selectors in General and cooldown action details. New drafts can change type and fields before being named, but Apply requires a nonempty, unique name."
L["Help.Effects.name"] = "为效果命名，该名称用于“常规”和冷却动作详情中的选择器。新草稿可以在命名前更改类型和字段，但“应用”要求名称非空且唯一。"
-- en: "Choose the highlight implementation. Changing type stages the new fields and resets its sequence because different sequence types store different values. Choosing the current type preserves existing values. Apply saves the change; Discard restores the saved effect."
L["Help.Effects.type"] = "选择高亮的实现方式。更改类型会暂存新的字段并重置其序列，因为不同的序列类型存储不同的值。选择当前类型会保留现有值。“应用”会保存更改；“放弃”会恢复已保存的效果。"
-- en: "Texture: overlay a single image from game data or an installed addon. Its color, magnification and position come from the profile or the individual cooldown."
L["Help.Effects.type.texture"] = "材质：叠加一张来自游戏数据或已安装插件的图像。其颜色、放大倍数和位置来自配置文件或单个冷却。"
-- en: "Pixel: animate short lines around the action icon border. Lines, Frequency, Length and Thickness control this library glow."
L["Help.Effects.type.pixel"] = "像素：在动作图标边框周围显示移动的短线条。“线条数”“频率”“长度”和“粗细”控制此函数库发光效果。"
-- en: "Auto Cast: animate groups of glowing particles around the action icon. Particles, Frequency and Scale control this library glow."
L["Help.Effects.type.autocast"] = "自动施法：在动作图标周围显示成组移动的发光粒子。“粒子数”“频率”和“缩放”控制此函数库发光效果。"
-- en: "Glow: use the familiar Blizzard-style button glow. Frequency controls its animation rate."
L["Help.Effects.type.blizzard"] = "发光：使用熟悉的暴雪风格按钮发光效果。“频率”控制其动画速率。"
-- en: "Dazzle: keep one texture and cycle through the sequence of colors. Each sequence card contains one RGBA color."
L["Help.Effects.type.dazzle"] = "炫光：保持同一材质，并依次循环序列中的颜色。每张序列卡片包含一种 RGBA 颜色。"
-- en: "Animate: cycle through the sequence of texture images. Each card selects one image and previews that selection."
L["Help.Effects.type.animate"] = "动画：依次循环序列中的材质图像。每张卡片选择一张图像并预览该选择。"
-- en: "Pulse: keep one texture and cycle through the sequence of magnifications. Each card selects one scale relative to the action icon."
L["Help.Effects.type.pulse"] = "脉冲：保持同一材质，并依次循环序列中的放大倍数。每张卡片选择一个相对于动作图标的缩放比例。"
-- en: "Rotate: animate one texture through evenly spaced angles around a full circle. Steps chooses the number of angles and Reverse changes their order."
L["Help.Effects.type.rotate"] = "旋转：让一张材质以均匀分布的角度旋转一整圈。“步数”选择角度数量，“反向”会改变其顺序。"
-- en: "Custom: cycle through cards containing a texture, angle, magnification and color. Each card supplies its own settings instead of relying on one shared texture."
L["Help.Effects.type.custom"] = "自定义：依次循环包含材质、角度、放大倍数和颜色的卡片。每张卡片提供各自的设置，而不是共用一张材质。"
-- en: "The image beside Name and Type previews the current draft with a white color and standard size. Texture and sequence changes update the preview without saving. Actual recommendations use their profile or cooldown color, size and offsets."
L["Help.Effects.preview"] = "“名称”和“类型”旁边的图像会以白色和标准大小预览当前草稿。材质和序列的更改会更新预览而不保存。实际推荐时使用其配置文件或冷却的颜色、大小和偏移。"
-- en: "For Texture, Dazzle, Pulse and Rotate, choose the image used throughout the effect. The arrow beside an image field opens the bundled overlay catalog with previews. Enter an available texture path or numeric file ID to use another image. Animate and Custom choose images in their sequence cards using the same controls. Selections update the draft and preview; Apply saves them."
L["Help.Effects.texture"] = "对于“材质”“炫光”“脉冲”和“旋转”，选择整个效果中使用的图像。图像字段旁边的箭头会打开附带预览的内置叠加图库。输入一个可用的材质路径或数字文件 ID 即可使用其他图像。“动画”和“自定义”在其序列卡片中使用相同的控件选择图像。选择会更新草稿和预览；“应用”会保存它们。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: choose the number of animated lines around the button, from 1 to 20."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.lines"] = "像素效果：选择按钮周围移动线条的数量，范围为 1 到 20。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: signed cycles per second. A larger magnitude moves faster; a negative value reverses direction. Zero uses the glow library default of one cycle every four seconds."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.frequency"] = "像素效果：每秒的循环次数（带正负号）。绝对值越大移动越快；负值会反转方向。为零时使用发光库的默认值，即每四秒一个循环。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: choose line length in pixels. The glow library limits it to the smaller button dimension."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.length"] = "像素效果：选择线条长度（像素）。发光库会将其限制为按钮较短的一边。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: choose line thickness in pixels, from 1 to 5."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.thickness"] = "像素效果：选择线条粗细（像素），范围为 1 到 5。"
-- en: "Auto Cast effects: choose 1 to 4 particles in each of the glow library particle groups."
L["Help.Effects.autocast.particles"] = "自动施法效果：选择发光库每个粒子组中的粒子数，范围为 1 到 4。"
-- en: "Auto Cast effects: signed cycles per second. A larger magnitude moves faster; a negative value reverses direction. Zero uses the glow library default of one cycle every eight seconds."
L["Help.Effects.autocast.frequency"] = "自动施法效果：每秒的循环次数（带正负号）。绝对值越大移动越快；负值会反转方向。为零时使用发光库的默认值，即每八秒一个循环。"
-- en: "Auto Cast effects: scale the particles relative to the glow library default. A value of 1 uses their normal size."
L["Help.Effects.autocast.scale"] = "自动施法效果：相对于发光库的默认值缩放粒子。值为 1 时使用其正常大小。"
-- en: "Glow effects: adjust the library animation rate. Larger positive values animate faster. Zero uses the library default rather than stopping the glow."
L["Help.Effects.blizzard.frequency"] = "发光效果：调整函数库的动画速率。正值越大动画越快。为零时使用函数库的默认值，而不是停止发光。"
-- en: "Dazzle effects: seconds between color cards. A smaller positive interval changes colors more often; the sequence repeats after the last color."
L["Help.Effects.dazzle.frequency"] = "炫光效果：颜色卡片之间的间隔秒数。正值越小，颜色变化越频繁；序列在最后一种颜色后重复。"
-- en: "Animate effects: seconds between texture cards. A smaller positive interval changes images more often; the sequence repeats after the last image."
L["Help.Effects.animate.frequency"] = "动画效果：材质卡片之间的间隔秒数。正值越小，图像变化越频繁；序列在最后一张图像后重复。"
-- en: "Pulse effects: seconds between magnification cards. A smaller positive interval changes size more often; the sequence repeats after the last size."
L["Help.Effects.pulse.frequency"] = "脉冲效果：放大倍数卡片之间的间隔秒数。正值越小，大小变化越频繁；序列在最后一个大小后重复。"
-- en: "Rotate effects: seconds between angle steps. A smaller positive interval rotates faster. One full cycle uses this interval multiplied by Steps."
L["Help.Effects.rotate.frequency"] = "旋转效果：每个角度步进之间的间隔秒数。正值越小旋转越快。一个完整循环的时长为此间隔乘以步数。"
-- en: "Rotate effects: choose 2 to 36 evenly spaced angles for a full turn. More steps at the same Frequency interval make a longer complete cycle."
L["Help.Effects.rotate.steps"] = "旋转效果：为一整圈选择 2 到 36 个均匀分布的角度。在相同的频率间隔下，步数越多，完整循环越长。"
-- en: "Rotate effects: reverse the order of angle steps. Changing this checkbox does not alter the texture or number of steps."
L["Help.Effects.rotate.reverse"] = "旋转效果：反转角度步进的顺序。更改此复选框不会改变材质或步数。"
-- en: "Custom effects: seconds between sequence cards. A smaller positive interval changes settings more often; the sequence repeats after the last card."
L["Help.Effects.custom.frequency"] = "自定义效果：序列卡片之间的间隔秒数。正值越小，设置变化越频繁；序列在最后一张卡片后重复。"
-- en: "Sequence cards play in order and repeat. Add step, on the Sequence header row, appends a card; drag Add step into a gap to insert one there. Drag a card into an insertion gap to reorder it; hold Ctrl when starting to carry it and all following cards. Up and Down move one card and are disabled at their respective ends. The red trash removes a card from the draft. Canceling a drag restores its original position."
L["Help.Effects.sequence"] = "序列卡片按顺序播放并重复。“序列”标题行上的“添加步骤”会追加一张卡片；将“添加步骤”拖入空隙可在该处插入。将卡片拖入插入空隙可重新排序；开始拖动时按住 Ctrl 可带上它及其后所有卡片。“上移”和“下移”每次移动一张卡片，到达两端时不可用。红色垃圾桶会从草稿中移除卡片。取消拖动会恢复其原始位置。"
-- en: "Animate and Custom cards: choose a texture path or numeric file ID. The card preview shows the selected image. Custom also keeps an independent angle, magnification and color on that card."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.texture"] = "“动画”和“自定义”卡片：选择材质路径或数字文件 ID。卡片预览会显示所选图像。“自定义”还会在该卡片上保留独立的角度、放大倍数和颜色。"
-- en: "Custom cards: set the texture angle in degrees from 0 to 359. This is the angle for this card, rather than a continuous rotation speed."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.angle"] = "“自定义”卡片：设置材质角度，单位为度，范围为 0 到 359。这是此卡片的角度，而不是持续旋转的速度。"
-- en: "Pulse and Custom cards: scale the texture relative to the action icon. A value of 1 uses the icon size. Use the slider or edit its numeric value."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.magnification"] = "“脉冲”和“自定义”卡片：相对于动作图标缩放材质。值为 1 时使用图标大小。使用滑块或编辑其数值。"
-- en: "Dazzle and Custom cards: choose an RGBA color. Click the swatch to open the picker, or edit channels between 0 and 1. Alpha controls opacity."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.color"] = "“炫光”和“自定义”卡片：选择一种 RGBA 颜色。点击色块可打开取色器，或编辑 0 到 1 之间的通道值。Alpha 控制不透明度。"
-- en: "Edits and sequence changes remain in a draft. Apply saves; Discard restores the saved effect. Cancel closes a new creation draft. View Changes compares saved and unsaved values. New drafts require a unique name and valid fields before Apply. Leaving with edits offers Apply, Discard or Cancel."
L["Help.Effects.save"] = "编辑和序列更改会保留在草稿中。“应用”会保存；“放弃”会恢复已保存的效果。“取消”会关闭新建的草稿。“查看更改”会比较已保存和未保存的值。新草稿在应用前需要唯一的名称和有效的字段。有编辑时离开会提供“应用”“放弃”或“取消”。"
-- en: "The red trash at the upper right deletes the selected effect after a permanent-deletion warning. Resolve pending edits first. Choose a replacement for any profile or cooldown using that effect; deletion does not silently rewrite those references."
L["Help.Effects.delete"] = "右上角的红色垃圾桶会在永久删除警告后删除所选效果。请先处理待处理的编辑。为任何使用该效果的配置文件或冷却选择替代效果；删除不会悄悄重写这些引用。"
-- en: "New, Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare are below the sidebar. Duplicate copies the selected effect into a draft. Transfers show the original name and let you create a renamed copy or replace the selection when allowed. Compare inspects differences without saving them."
L["Help.Effects.collections"] = "“新建”“复制”“导入/导出”和“比较”位于侧边栏下方。“复制”会将所选效果复制到一个草稿中。传输时会显示原始名称，并允许你创建一个重命名的副本，或在允许时替换所选项。“比较”会检查差异但不保存。"
-- en: "Debuffs"
L["Debuffs"] = "减益效果"
-- en: "Resources"
L["Resources"] = "资源"
-- en: "Pet"
L["Pet"] = "宠物"
-- en: "Logic"
L["Logic"] = "逻辑"
-- en: "Environment"
L["Environment"] = "环境"
-- en: "Time"
L["Time"] = "时间"
-- en: "Spell Auto-Repeat Active"
L["Spell Auto-Repeat Active"] = "法术自动重复中"
-- en: "%s {{!is|is not}} auto-repeating"
L["%s {{!is|is not}} auto-repeating"] = "%s{{!正在|没有在}}自动重复"
-- en: "Tests whether the selected spell is currently auto-repeating, such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is different from a spell being current or queued: a queued cast alone does not satisfy this condition. Unavailable client observations remain unavailable even when negated."
L["Tests whether the selected spell is currently auto-repeating, such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is different from a spell being current or queued: a queued cast alone does not satisfy this condition. Unavailable client observations remain unavailable even when negated."] = "检测所选法术当前是否在自动重复，例如射击或自动射击。这与法术处于当前或排队状态不同：仅有排队的施法并不满足此条件。不可用的客户端观测即使被取反也仍为不可用。"
-- en: "Uses readable positions in the same instance, or player-centered range estimates when positions are unavailable. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance. Uncertain positions, range, subgroup membership or required health/mana values keep the whole condition unavailable, including under Unless. Percentage checks require a positive maximum; empty aggregates have no result."
L["Uses readable positions in the same instance, or player-centered range estimates when positions are unavailable. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance. Uncertain positions, range, subgroup membership or required health/mana values keep the whole condition unavailable, including under Unless. Percentage checks require a positive maximum; empty aggregates have no result."] = "使用同一副本中可读的位置；位置不可用时，使用以玩家为中心的距离估算。只有当某个单位的距离上限在“距离”之内时才计入。位置、距离、小队成员身份或所需的生命值/法力值不确定时，整个条件将为不可用，在“除非”下同样如此。百分比检查要求最大值为正；空的汇总没有结果。"
-- en: "Count enemies when selected, or non-enemies when cleared."
L["Count enemies when selected, or non-enemies when cleared."] = "勾选时统计敌人，取消勾选时统计非敌人。"
-- en: "The number of observed units proven within Distance of you."
L["The number of observed units proven within Distance of you."] = "已确认位于你“距离”范围内的已观测单位数量。"
-- en: "Counts the addon's observed unit snapshot, including nameplates and tracked unit aliases, rather than every nearby unit. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance; uncertain membership or unreadable identity, hostility, range or nameplate settings makes the whole count unavailable, including under Unless. Known vanished or reused unit tokens are excluded. Distance cannot exceed the current nameplate distance setting; that setting does not guarantee a complete scan."
L["Counts the addon's observed unit snapshot, including nameplates and tracked unit aliases, rather than every nearby unit. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance; uncertain membership or unreadable identity, hostility, range or nameplate settings makes the whole count unavailable, including under Unless. Known vanished or reused unit tokens are excluded. Distance cannot exceed the current nameplate distance setting; that setting does not guarantee a complete scan."] = "统计的是插件已观测到的单位快照，包括姓名板和被追踪的单位别名，而不是附近的每个单位。只有当某个单位的距离上限在“距离”之内时才计入；成员身份不确定，或身份、敌对状态、距离或姓名板设置无法读取，都会使整个计数为不可用，在“除非”下同样如此。已知消失或被重复使用的单位标识会被排除。“距离”不能超过当前的姓名板距离设置；该设置也不能保证扫描完整。"
-- en: "Selecting a sidebar row only inspects that profile. Activate profile switches the live profile immediately, including its rotations and settings. The active profile shows Active profile instead. This operation does not wait for page Apply."
L["Help.Profiles.activate"] = "选择侧边栏中的一行只会查看该配置文件。“激活配置文件”会立即切换实际使用的配置文件，包括其循环和设置。当前激活的配置文件会显示为“当前配置文件”。此操作不需要等待页面上的“应用”。"
-- en: "Choose a source to replace the active profile after confirmation. This copies settings and rotations into the active profile, even when the sidebar is inspecting a different profile. It does not switch to the source or rename the active profile. Cancel at the confirmation preserves the current profile."
L["Help.Profiles.copy"] = "选择一个来源，在确认后替换当前激活的配置文件。这会将设置和循环复制到当前激活的配置文件中，即使侧边栏正在查看另一个配置文件。它不会切换到来源配置文件，也不会重命名当前配置文件。在确认时点击“取消”会保留当前配置文件。"
-- en: "Reset current profile replaces the active profile with its defaults after confirmation. Custom rotations and settings in it are replaced. The control is disabled while inspecting another profile. Reset is immediate after confirmation; there is no later page Apply to undo it."
L["Help.Profiles.reset"] = "“重置当前配置文件”会在确认后用默认值替换当前激活的配置文件。其中的自定义循环和设置会被替换。查看其他配置文件时此控件不可用。重置在确认后立即生效；之后没有页面上的“应用”可以撤销它。"
-- en: "The red trash can permanently removes the selected inactive profile after confirmation. The active profile and Default cannot be deleted here. Selecting another profile does not delete or activate it."
L["Help.Profiles.delete"] = "红色垃圾桶会在确认后永久移除所选的未激活配置文件。当前激活的配置文件和 Default 不能在此删除。选择另一个配置文件不会删除或激活它。"
-- en: "New and Duplicate open a named draft. Use a nonblank, unused name of at most 50 characters. Apply creates the profile; Cancel abandons creation. Creating a profile leaves the previously active profile active, so use Activate profile when you want to switch to the new copy."
L["Help.Profiles.new_name"] = "“新建”和“复制”会打开一个命名草稿。请使用不超过 50 个字符、非空且未被使用的名称。“应用”会创建配置文件；“取消”会放弃创建。创建配置文件后，之前激活的配置文件仍保持激活，因此想切换到新副本时请使用“激活配置文件”。"
-- en: "The buttons below the list create a new profile, duplicate the selected profile, transfer profiles or compare saved settings. Search narrows the list without activating a profile. Import/Export shows the original name and lets you replace the selection or create a renamed copy. Importing a new profile opens a creation draft; Apply saves it. Replacing a selected profile happens when you confirm the import, and replacing the active profile updates its runtime settings. Compare does not apply changes."
L["Help.Profiles.collections"] = "列表下方的按钮可新建配置文件、复制所选配置文件、传输配置文件或比较已保存的设置。搜索会缩小列表范围，但不会激活配置文件。“导入/导出”会显示原始名称，并允许你替换所选项或创建一个重命名的副本。导入新配置文件会打开一个新建草稿；“应用”会保存它。替换所选配置文件会在你确认导入时发生，替换当前激活的配置文件会更新其运行时设置。“比较”不会应用更改。"
-- en: "Status pills show Not loaded, Supported, Disabled, Enabled or Selected. Click Enabled to Select or Disable. Disabling Selected chooses the sole enabled available editor, offers a choice when several exist, or leaves none selected. Enabling an editor when none is selected selects it automatically. Native is always available; its Syntax highlighting option is independent of editor selection. With no enabled editor, emergency plain text remains usable. Apply saves preferences for the next source-editor opening; Discard keeps saved settings. An open editor keeps its current provider."
L["Help.Integrations.lua_editor"] = "状态标签会显示“未加载”“受支持”“已禁用”“已启用”或“已选择”。点击“已启用”可选择或禁用。禁用“已选择”的编辑器时，若只有一个已启用的可用编辑器则自动选择它，若有多个则让你选择，否则不选择任何编辑器。在没有已选编辑器时启用一个编辑器会自动选择它。“原生”始终可用；其“语法高亮”选项与编辑器选择无关。没有已启用的编辑器时，应急纯文本仍可使用。“应用”会保存偏好，供下次打开源码编辑器时使用；“放弃”会保留已保存的设置。已打开的编辑器会保持其当前的提供者。"
-- en: "Show line numbers controls the gutter in every condition and function code editor. It defaults to enabled. Apply saves the preference and updates open code panes; Discard keeps the saved setting. It does not change the Lua source or its line breaks."
L["Help.Integrations.lua_line_numbers"] = "“显示行号”控制每个条件和函数代码编辑器中的行号栏。默认启用。“应用”会保存偏好并更新已打开的代码面板；“放弃”会保留已保存的设置。它不会更改 Lua 源码或其换行。"
-- en: "Addon names open copyable official release and source links across available providers. Edition filtering follows declared support for the matching addon identity; unknown compatibility remains visible. An older release date alone does not prove incompatibility. Listed game-edition support describes publisher release evidence, not certification of the integration on your client. Some integrations have only historical or unverified releases. Not loaded means unavailable to RM; Supported identifies an available integration without an enable switch. Bundled libraries are excluded. Rotation Master does not install or enable other addons."
L["Help.Integrations.optional_addons"] = "点击插件名称会打开可复制的官方发布页和源码链接，涵盖所有可用的提供平台。版本筛选依据相应插件身份所声明的支持；兼容性未知的项目仍会显示。仅凭较早的发布日期并不能证明不兼容。所列出的游戏版本支持描述的是发布者的发布证据，而不是对该集成在你客户端上的认证。部分集成只有历史版本或未经验证的版本。“未加载”表示 RM 无法使用；“受支持”表示一个可用但没有启用开关的集成。内嵌的函数库不在此列。Rotation Master 不会安装或启用其他插件。"
-- en: "Apply / Discard"
L["Apply / Discard"] = "应用 / 放弃"
-- en: "Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Discard abandons pending changes. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel; Cancel keeps the page and draft open. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."
L["Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Discard abandons pending changes. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel; Cancel keeps the page and draft open. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."] = "编辑内容会保留为草稿，直到点击“应用”。“放弃”会丢弃待处理的更改。有更改时离开会提供“应用”“放弃”或“取消”；“取消”会保持页面和草稿打开。效果预览不会保存更改。动作条绑定操作是显式的，且立即生效。"
-- en: "Diagram / List changes only the rotation view; General settings choose the default. Diagram has floating minus, percentage and plus controls at the bottom right. Scroll to zoom from 25% to 200%; click the percentage or middle-click to reset to 100%. Drag empty diagram space to pan. List uses normal scrollbars with touching cards and boxed branch arms, False before True. Cooldowns use a separate scrolling grid. Dragging cards reorders them in every view. Valid rotation bodies can contain up to 2,000 total steps; large workspaces reuse nearby card controls as you navigate. Folded branches intentionally hide their children."
L["Diagram / List changes only the rotation view; General settings choose the default. Diagram has floating minus, percentage and plus controls at the bottom right. Scroll to zoom from 25% to 200%; click the percentage or middle-click to reset to 100%. Drag empty diagram space to pan. List uses normal scrollbars with touching cards and boxed branch arms, False before True. Cooldowns use a separate scrolling grid. Dragging cards reorders them in every view. Valid rotation bodies can contain up to 2,000 total steps; large workspaces reuse nearby card controls as you navigate. Folded branches intentionally hide their children."] = "“图表 / 列表”只改变循环视图；默认视图在常规设置中选择。图表视图右下角有浮动的减号、百分比和加号控件。滚动滚轮可在 25% 到 200% 之间缩放；点击百分比或按鼠标中键可重置为 100%。拖动图表空白处可平移。列表视图使用普通滚动条，卡片紧密相连，分支以方框显示，“假”在“真”之前。冷却使用单独的可滚动网格。在任意视图中拖动卡片都可重新排序。有效的循环主体最多可包含 2,000 个步骤；大型工作区会在你浏览时复用附近的卡片控件。折叠的分支会刻意隐藏其子项。"
-- en: "New / Duplicate / Import / Compare"
L["New / Duplicate / Import / Compare"] = "新建 / 复制 / 导入 / 比较"
-- en: "Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."
L["Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."] = "选择一个分类并搜索条件。“隐藏”会将其从选择器中移除，但不删除其定义。“切换条件”控制它能否用于自动切换循环。“移动到”会暂存一个目标分类；其“应用”按钮会确认移动。点击已分配的分类会打开分类管理。侧边栏箭头和拖动可调整条目顺序。页面上的“应用”会保存草稿；“放弃”会丢弃对已保存条目的编辑。自定义条件可以编辑、复制或删除。"
-- en: "Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Import stages a validated replacement."
L["Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Import stages a validated replacement."] = "选择一个效果以编辑其名称、类型及该类型特有的设置。图标会实时预览效果。序列部分按顺序编辑动画、颜色、脉冲或自定义帧。“复制”会创建一个独立的效果。拖动序列卡片的表面可重新排序；字段仍可编辑。新效果可以在命名前先进行配置。“应用”会保存草稿；“放弃”会丢弃对已保存条目的编辑。“导入”会暂存一个经过验证的替换项。"
-- en: "Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."
L["Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."] = "选择一个物品组并编辑其优先级列表。“全局”会在所有配置文件间共享该物品组。移动箭头可更改物品优先级。“绑定物品组”会拾取一件可用物品以放置到动作条上；解绑时，绑定标签会在非战斗状态下移除动作条上匹配的已绑定动作。“重置”会恢复内置的物品组。在引用字段中搜索或拖入物品。“应用”会保存设置；“放弃”会丢弃对已保存条目的编辑。绑定的更改是显式的动作条操作。"
-- en: "Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid text stays red and must be corrected before Apply; Discard can abandon it. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."
L["Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid text stays red and must be corrected before Apply; Discard can abandon it. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."] = "按 Enter 或离开文本字段即可暂存其值；“应用”会保存草稿。无效文本会保持红色，必须在应用前更正；“放弃”可以丢弃它。可搜索的选择器在点击时打开，并随输入进行筛选。分节标题可折叠或展开其内容。"
-- en: "Apply changes to this selected item list. Other settings keep their own Apply action."
L["Apply changes to this selected item list. Other settings keep their own Apply action."] = "将更改应用到此所选物品列表。其他设置各自有其“应用”操作。"
-- en: "Choose an item list before editing."
L["Choose an item list before editing."] = "编辑前请先选择一个物品列表。"
-- en: "The item list changed elsewhere. Close and reopen it before applying."
L["The item list changed elsewhere. Close and reopen it before applying."] = "物品列表已在别处更改。请关闭并重新打开后再应用。"
-- en: "Editing this list"
L["Editing this list"] = "编辑此列表"
-- en: "This window edits only the item list you opened. Search or drag items into the fields, then arrange preferred items first. A named item set is shared by its other users; a custom list belongs to the calling condition or action draft. Applying this list does not apply the parent editor."
L["Help.ItemSets.popup.overview"] = "此窗口只编辑你打开的物品列表。在字段中搜索或拖入物品，然后将首选物品排在前面。命名的物品组由其他引用方共享；自定义列表属于调用它的条件或动作草稿。应用此列表不会应用其上级编辑器。"
-- en: "Use a row's red trash can to remove that entry from the draft list. This does not delete a named item set or remove an item from your inventory. The removal takes effect when you Apply this list."
L["Help.ItemSets.popup.delete"] = "使用某一行的红色垃圾桶可将该条目从草稿列表中移除。这不会删除命名的物品组，也不会从你的背包中移除物品。移除会在你应用此列表时生效。"
-- en: "Apply validates every entry and writes the edited list back to its original owner. Discard closes without changing it. Closing with pending edits offers Apply, Discard or Cancel; Cancel keeps this window open. View Changes compares the original list with this draft. If the original list changed elsewhere, close and reopen it before applying."
L["Help.ItemSets.popup.save"] = "“应用”会验证每个条目，并将编辑后的列表写回其原始所有者。“放弃”会关闭而不做更改。有待处理的编辑时关闭会提供“应用”“放弃”或“取消”；“取消”会保持此窗口打开。“查看更改”会比较原始列表与此草稿。如果原始列表已在别处更改，请关闭并重新打开后再应用。"
-- en: "Native settings page unavailable: %s"
L["Native settings page unavailable: %s"] = "原生设置页面不可用：%s"
-- en: "The native rotation editor is unavailable."
L["The native rotation editor is unavailable."] = "原生循环编辑器不可用。"
-- en: "Required"
L["Required"] = "必填"
-- en: "Required field references need review. Apply keeps the displayed root requirements."
L["Required field references need review. Apply keeps the displayed root requirements."] = "必填字段的引用需要检查。“应用”会保留所显示的根级必填要求。"
-- en: "Required root fields must have a value before this condition can run. Rename, reorder and duplicate keep this flag; removing the field removes its requirement. Moving it into a nested structure makes it optional. Undo restores both. Callback code is unchanged."
L["Required root fields must have a value before this condition can run. Rename, reorder and duplicate keep this flag; removing the field removes its requirement. Moving it into a nested structure makes it optional. Undo restores both. Callback code is unchanged."] = "根级必填字段必须有值，此条件才能运行。重命名、重新排序和复制都会保留此标记；移除字段会移除其必填要求。将其移入嵌套结构会使其变为可选。撤销会同时恢复两者。回调代码保持不变。"
-- en: "Copy condition description"
L["Copy condition description"] = "复制条件描述"
-- en: "This condition exceeds the supported editor limits."
L["This condition exceeds the supported editor limits."] = "此条件超出了编辑器支持的上限。"
-- en: "Proc Glow"
L["Proc Glow"] = "触发发光"
-- en: "Loop duration"
L["Loop duration"] = "循环时长"
-- en: "Start burst"
L["Start burst"] = "开场爆发"
-- en: "Proc Glow is unavailable on this client; Pixel glow will be used."
L["Proc Glow is unavailable on this client; Pixel glow will be used."] = "此客户端不支持触发发光；将改用像素发光。"
-- en: "Proc Glow: use the animated actionbar proc border from LibCustomGlow. Rotation Master checks the required game artwork and animation support before using it. Unsupported clients use Pixel glow instead; the definition remains portable. Color and offsets come from the profile or the cooldown."
L["Help.Effects.type.proc"] = "触发发光：使用 LibCustomGlow 提供的动作条触发动画边框。Rotation Master 在使用前会检查所需的游戏美术资源和动画支持。不支持的客户端会改用像素发光；定义本身仍可移植。颜色和偏移来自配置文件或冷却。"
-- en: "Time in seconds for one repeating proc-border animation, from 0.1 to 5. Use the slider or enter an exact value in its number field. Changing the value updates the preview."
L["Help.Effects.proc.duration"] = "一次重复的触发边框动画所需的时间，单位为秒，范围为 0.1 到 5。使用滑块或在数字字段中输入精确值。更改数值会更新预览。"
-- en: "Play the opening burst when this highlight first appears, then repeat its border animation. Off by default. Refreshing an already visible Proc Glow does not restart the burst."
L["Help.Effects.proc.startAnim"] = "在此高亮首次出现时播放开场爆发，然后重复其边框动画。默认关闭。刷新已显示的触发发光不会重新播放爆发。"
-- en: "Rotation data requires recovery: %s"
L["Rotation data requires recovery: %s"] = "循环数据需要恢复：%s"
-- en: "Copies belong to your Class unless This character is selected. Replacement keeps its original owner."
L["Copies belong to your Class unless This character is selected. Replacement keeps its original owner."] = "除非选择了“此角色”，否则副本属于你的职业。替换会保留其原始所有者。"
-- en: "Archive report truncated; saved data is unchanged."
L["Archive report truncated; saved data is unchanged."] = "存档报告已截断；已保存的数据未更改。"
-- en: "Recover unassigned rotations"
L["Recover unassigned rotations"] = "恢复未分配的循环"
-- en: "Ownership required"
L["Ownership required"] = "需要指定所有者"
-- en: "These records have no assigned owner. Choose Class or This character explicitly. No ownership is inferred from names, spells or profile history."
L["These records have no assigned owner. Choose Class or This character explicitly. No ownership is inferred from names, spells or profile history."] = "这些记录没有分配所有者。请明确选择“职业”或“此角色”。不会根据名称、法术或配置文件历史推断所有权。"
-- en: "Recovery unavailable: %s"
L["Recovery unavailable: %s"] = "无法恢复：%s"
-- en: "Unassigned rotation archive"
L["Unassigned rotation archive"] = "未分配循环存档"
-- en: "Character archive"
L["Character archive"] = "角色存档"
-- en: "Profile archive"
L["Profile archive"] = "配置文件存档"
-- en: "No unassigned rotations."
L["No unassigned rotations."] = "没有未分配的循环。"
-- en: "Archive: %s; specialization: %s; identifier: %s"
L["Archive: %s; specialization: %s; identifier: %s"] = "存档：%s；专精：%s；标识符：%s"
-- en: "Export archive"
L["Export archive"] = "导出存档"
-- en: "Adopt rotation"
L["Adopt rotation"] = "认领循环"
-- en: "Could not adopt this record: %s"
L["Could not adopt this record: %s"] = "无法认领此记录：%s"
-- en: "More than one rotation is named %s. Select its Class or This character entry in the rotation browser."
L["More than one rotation is named %s. Select its Class or This character entry in the rotation browser."] = "有多个循环名为 %s。请在循环浏览器中选择其“职业”或“此角色”条目。"
-- en: "The fallback rotation is unavailable. Open Rotations to complete or recover it."
L["The fallback rotation is unavailable. Open Rotations to complete or recover it."] = "后备循环不可用。请打开“循环”以完成或恢复它。"
-- en: "Class rotations are shared by characters of the same class in this settings profile. This character limits the rotation to your current character. Applying a scope change moves the complete saved rotation; an existing destination is never overwritten."
L["Class rotations are shared by characters of the same class in this settings profile. This character limits the rotation to your current character. Applying a scope change moves the complete saved rotation; an existing destination is never overwritten."] = "职业循环在此设置配置文件中由同一职业的角色共享。“此角色”会将循环限制为你当前的角色。应用范围更改会移动整个已保存的循环；永远不会覆盖已存在的目标。"
-- en: "Rotations belong to the active settings profile. New copies use Class, shared by your characters of that class; Metadata can change this to This character. Built In rotations show only for their declared class or universal use. Equal identifiers in different owners remain separate entries."
L["Rotations belong to the active settings profile. New copies use Class, shared by your characters of that class; Metadata can change this to This character. Built In rotations show only for their declared class or universal use. Equal identifiers in different owners remain separate entries."] = "循环属于当前激活的设置配置文件。新副本使用“职业”，由你该职业的所有角色共享；可在元数据中将其改为“此角色”。内置循环只对其声明的职业或通用用途显示。不同所有者下的相同标识符仍是各自独立的条目。"
-- en: "Older rotations without a recorded owner stay in an archive. Recover unassigned rotations opens the current profile and character archives for inspection or copying. Choose Class or This character to adopt one. Adoption preserves its identifier and evidence, refuses an existing destination, and leaves incomplete records unavailable until repaired."
L["Older rotations without a recorded owner stay in an archive. Recover unassigned rotations opens the current profile and character archives for inspection or copying. Choose Class or This character to adopt one. Adoption preserves its identifier and evidence, refuses an existing destination, and leaves incomplete records unavailable until repaired."] = "没有记录所有者的旧循环会保留在存档中。“恢复未分配的循环”会打开当前配置文件和角色的存档以供查看或复制。选择“职业”或“此角色”即可认领一个。认领会保留其标识符和证据，拒绝已存在的目标，并让不完整的记录在修复前保持不可用。"
-- en: "Unsupported condition editor frame."
L["Unsupported condition editor frame."] = "不支持的条件编辑器框体。"
-- en: "The native condition editor is unavailable."
L["The native condition editor is unavailable."] = "原生条件编辑器不可用。"
-- en: "Native custom condition editor required."
L["Native custom condition editor required."] = "需要原生自定义条件编辑器。"
-- en: "Stock"
L["Stock"] = "原版"
-- en: "Target"
L["Target"] = "目标"
-- en: "you {{!have|do not have}} {item} equipped"
L["you {{!have|do not have}} {item} equipped"] = "你{{!已|未}}装备{item}"
-- en: "{item} {{!is|is not}} available{carrying}"
L["{item} {{!is|is not}} available{carrying}"] = "{item}{{!可用|不可用}}{carrying}"
-- en: "{item} {{!is|is not}} in range{carrying}"
L["{item} {{!is|is not}} in range{carrying}"] = "{item}{{!在|不在}}射程内{carrying}"
