L["Coverage rows: advice=%d presentation=%d visible=%d hidden=%d unknown=%d retired=%d (not opportunities)."] = "覆盖行数：建议=%d 展示=%d 可见=%d 隐藏=%d 未知=%d 已退役=%d（并非机会次数）。"
