-- en: "Saved settings"
L["Saved settings"] = "已保存的设置"
-- en: "Silent"
L["Silent"] = "静默"
-- en: "Set Pieces"
L["Set Pieces"] = "套装件数"
-- en: "Weapon Imbue"
L["Weapon Imbue"] = "武器灌注"
-- en: "Absolute health target (negative means deficit) or percentage fraction."
L["Absolute health target (negative means deficit) or percentage fraction."] = "绝对生命值目标（负数表示缺口）或百分比小数。"
-- en: "All original results, preserving nil positions and return count."
L["All original results, preserving nil positions and return count."] = "所有原始结果，保留 nil 的位置和返回值数量。"
-- en: "Apply the legacy integer or canonical numeric-string spelling test. Numbers use floor equality; strings must equal the spelling obtained after numeric conversion and floor. Other types return false. This is not a finite-number validator."
L["Apply the legacy integer or canonical numeric-string spelling test. Numbers use floor equality; strings must equal the spelling obtained after numeric conversion and floor. Other types return false. This is not a finite-number validator."] = "执行旧版的整数或规范数字字符串拼写测试。数字使用向下取整后的相等比较；字符串必须等于经数字转换并向下取整后得到的拼写。其他类型返回 false。这不是有限数字的验证器。"
-- en: "Arguments forwarded unchanged to the observed function."
L["Arguments forwarded unchanged to the observed function."] = "原样转发给被观测函数的参数。"
-- en: "Arguments forwarded unchanged; types, identity, arity and nil positions distinguish cache entries."
L["Arguments forwarded unchanged; types, identity, arity and nil positions distinguish cache entries."] = "原样转发的参数；类型、身份、参数数量和 nil 位置用于区分缓存条目。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level observation."
L["Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level observation."] = "等级观测为 nil 时的可用性或查询验证原因。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level."
L["Availability or query-validation reason for a nil level."] = "等级为 nil 时的可用性或查询验证原因。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason when no current state can be read."
L["Availability or query-validation reason when no current state can be read."] = "无法读取当前状态时的可用性或查询验证原因。"
-- en: "Availability or query-validation reason when the whole observation is unavailable."
L["Availability or query-validation reason when the whole observation is unavailable."] = "整个观测不可用时的可用性或查询验证原因。"
-- en: "Availability or validation reason for a nil result."
L["Availability or validation reason for a nil result."] = "结果为 nil 时的可用性或验证原因。"
-- en: "Availability or validation reason when the record is nil."
L["Availability or validation reason when the record is nil."] = "记录为 nil 时的可用性或验证原因。"
-- en: "Availability or validation reason when the result is nil."
L["Availability or validation reason when the result is nil."] = "结果为 nil 时的可用性或验证原因。"
-- en: "Availability reason for a nil result."
L["Availability reason for a nil result."] = "结果为 nil 时的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Availability reason when resolution fails; nil on success."
L["Availability reason when resolution fails; nil on success."] = "解析失败时的可用性原因；成功时为 nil。"
-- en: "Cache an observation after it returns a non-nil value; retry observations whose entire return tuple is nil. Uses the same exact argument keys as getCached."
L["Cache an observation after it returns a non-nil value; retry observations whose entire return tuple is nil. Uses the same exact argument keys as getCached."] = "在观测返回非 nil 值后将其缓存；对整个返回元组都为 nil 的观测会重试。使用与 getCached 完全相同的参数键。"
-- en: "Calculate a checked health-history rate using an explicit finite window and clock. Preserve ordered weighting, per-row live canonical rounding, skipped streams, array holes, fractional keys and final visited ages. A fixed 4096-unit budget covers visited rows and accumulation bins across both streams; excess or invalid consumed arithmetic returns unavailable, never a partial estimate or clamp. This new API has its own source identity; historical trend functions remain unchanged."
L["Calculate a checked health-history rate using an explicit finite window and clock. Preserve ordered weighting, per-row live canonical rounding, skipped streams, array holes, fractional keys and final visited ages. A fixed 4096-unit budget covers visited rows and accumulation bins across both streams; excess or invalid consumed arithmetic returns unavailable, never a partial estimate or clamp. This new API has its own source identity; historical trend functions remain unchanged."] = "使用显式的有限时间窗口和时钟，计算经过检查的生命值历史速率。保留有序加权、逐行实时规范舍入、被跳过的数据流、数组空洞、小数键以及最终访问时的时长。固定的 4096 单位预算涵盖两个数据流中被访问的行和累加区间；超出预算或无效的已消耗运算会返回不可用，绝不返回部分估算或截断值。这个新 API 有其自己的源码身份；历史趋势函数保持不变。"
-- en: "Call an observation once per cache and exact argument tuple, including nil results. Pass the evaluation cache to share observations within a recommendation cycle; nil cache calls directly."
L["Call an observation once per cache and exact argument tuple, including nil results. Pass the evaluation cache to share observations within a recommendation cycle; nil cache calls directly."] = "对每个缓存和完全相同的参数元组只调用一次观测，包括 nil 结果。传入评估缓存可在一个推荐周期内共享观测；缓存为 nil 时直接调用。"
-- en: "Callback invoked after changing the selected unit."
L["Callback invoked after changing the selected unit."] = "更改所选单位后调用的回调。"
-- en: "Callback receiving the committed spell value."
L["Callback receiving the committed spell value."] = "接收已提交法术值的回调。"
-- en: "Caller-owned evaluation observation cache; nil queries afresh."
L["Caller-owned evaluation observation cache; nil queries afresh."] = "由调用方拥有的评估观测缓存；为 nil 时重新查询。"
-- en: "Capability or clock observation availability reason."
L["Capability or clock observation availability reason."] = "能力或时钟观测的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Capability or observation availability reason for a nil class."
L["Capability or observation availability reason for a nil class."] = "职业为 nil 时的能力或观测可用性原因。"
-- en: "Check whether a table has a non-nil value at a key. A stored false value still counts as present; this does not scan table values."
L["Check whether a table has a non-nil value at a key. A stored false value still counts as present; this does not scan table values."] = "检查表中某个键是否有非 nil 的值。存储的 false 值仍算作存在；这不会扫描表中的值。"
-- en: "Checkbox widget with boolean value and callback methods."
L["Checkbox widget with boolean value and callback methods."] = "带有布尔值和回调方法的复选框控件。"
-- en: "Choose the supplied player value only for the literal player unit token; every other unit selects the nonplayer value. Selected false and nil values are preserved."
L["Choose the supplied player value only for the literal player unit token; every other unit selects the nonplayer value. Selected false and nil values are preserved."] = "仅当单位标识为字面上的 player 时才选择所提供的玩家值；其他所有单位都会选择非玩家值。选中的 false 和 nil 值会被保留。"
-- en: "Classification, validation or availability reason for a nil result."
L["Classification, validation or availability reason for a nil result."] = "结果为 nil 时的分类、验证或可用性原因。"
-- en: "Classify a numeric item as a glyph for the requested class, using guarded native item metadata. Class is optional and defaults to the readable player class. This establishes item classification only, not equipped status or an item-to-glyph-spell ID mapping."
L["Classify a numeric item as a glyph for the requested class, using guarded native item metadata. Class is optional and defaults to the readable player class. This establishes item classification only, not equipped status or an item-to-glyph-spell ID mapping."] = "使用受保护的原生物品元数据，将一个数字物品归类为所请求职业的雕文。职业是可选的，默认为可读取的玩家职业。这只确定物品分类，不确定装备状态，也不提供物品到雕文法术 ID 的映射。"
-- en: "Client-family, query-validation or required-observation availability reason for a nil result."
L["Client-family, query-validation or required-observation availability reason for a nil result."] = "结果为 nil 时的客户端系列、查询验证或所需观测的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil form."
L["Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil form."] = "形态为 nil 时的客户端策略、能力、调用或观测可用性原因。"
-- en: "Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil record."
L["Client-policy, capability, call or observation availability reason for a nil record."] = "记录为 nil 时的客户端策略、能力、调用或观测可用性原因。"
-- en: "Client-policy, native-call or required membership availability reason for a nil record."
L["Client-policy, native-call or required membership availability reason for a nil record."] = "记录为 nil 时的客户端策略、原生调用或所需成员身份的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Closed kind: runner, resist or immune."
L["Closed kind: runner, resist or immune."] = "封闭的种类：runner、resist 或 immune。"
-- en: "Closed scalar kind: current or maximum."
L["Closed scalar kind: current or maximum."] = "封闭的标量种类：current 或 maximum。"
-- en: "Collect table keys and sort them by their associated values using Lua less-than comparison. This sorts values rather than key names; equal values have no guaranteed key order."
L["Collect table keys and sort them by their associated values using Lua less-than comparison. This sorts values rather than key names; equal values have no guaranteed key order."] = "收集表的键，并使用 Lua 的小于比较按其对应的值排序。这是按值排序而不是按键名排序；值相等时键的顺序不确定。"
-- en: "Combat-policy, capability, observation or scan-budget reason for a nil count."
L["Combat-policy, capability, observation or scan-budget reason for a nil count."] = "计数为 nil 时的战斗策略、能力、观测或扫描预算原因。"
-- en: "Combined signed weighted rate from the original formula; malformed or nonfinite inputs retain the legacy error/numeric behavior."
L["Combined signed weighted rate from the original formula; malformed or nonfinite inputs retain the legacy error/numeric behavior."] = "来自原始公式的带符号加权合并速率；格式错误或非有限的输入保留旧版的错误/数值行为。"
-- en: "Compare the selected unit creature ID with one existing saved creature-type key. Resolve the fixed key-to-ID identity in one private executable mapper; gameplay matching does not depend on the mutable localized UI caption map. Share complete native observations within the supplied evaluation-pass cache by actual observer, receiver and unit, including absence and unavailable reasons. Known absence or a known different ID returns false; an unavailable required observation returns nil with a reason. No longterm state or caption mutation is added."
L["Compare the selected unit creature ID with one existing saved creature-type key. Resolve the fixed key-to-ID identity in one private executable mapper; gameplay matching does not depend on the mutable localized UI caption map. Share complete native observations within the supplied evaluation-pass cache by actual observer, receiver and unit, including absence and unavailable reasons. Known absence or a known different ID returns false; an unavailable required observation returns nil with a reason. No longterm state or caption mutation is added."] = "将所选单位的生物 ID 与一个现有的已保存生物类型键进行比较。在一个私有的可执行映射器中解析固定的键到 ID 的对应；游戏中的匹配不依赖可变的本地化界面标题映射。在所提供的评估轮次缓存中，按实际的观测者、接收者和单位共享完整的原生观测，包括不存在和不可用的原因。已知不存在或已知 ID 不同时返回 false；所需观测不可用时返回 nil 及原因。不会添加长期状态或修改标题。"
-- en: "Compare two exact unit tokens using UnitIsUnit after checking only the first token with UnitExists. A readable absent first unit returns false without comparing. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. No second existence query, GUID lookup or inferred identity is added."
L["Compare two exact unit tokens using UnitIsUnit after checking only the first token with UnitExists. A readable absent first unit returns false without comparing. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. No second existence query, GUID lookup or inferred identity is added."] = "只用 UnitExists 检查第一个单位标识后，使用 UnitIsUnit 比较两个确切的单位标识。若第一个单位可读且不存在，则不进行比较直接返回 false。所需的观测缺失、失败、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。不会额外进行第二次存在性查询、GUID 查找或推断身份。"
-- en: "Compare two values using an RM operator identifier: LESSTHAN, LESSTHANOREQUALS, GREATERTHAN, GREATERTHANOREQUALS, EQUALS, NOTEQUALS or DIVISIBLE. Invalid operators warn and return nil; operands must support the selected Lua operation."
L["Compare two values using an RM operator identifier: LESSTHAN, LESSTHANOREQUALS, GREATERTHAN, GREATERTHANOREQUALS, EQUALS, NOTEQUALS or DIVISIBLE. Invalid operators warn and return nil; operands must support the selected Lua operation."] = "使用 RM 运算符标识符比较两个值：LESSTHAN、LESSTHANOREQUALS、GREATERTHAN、GREATERTHANOREQUALS、EQUALS、NOTEQUALS 或 DIVISIBLE。无效的运算符会发出警告并返回 nil；操作数必须支持所选的 Lua 运算。"
-- en: "Comparison operator key, such as EQUALS or LESSTHAN."
L["Comparison operator key, such as EQUALS or LESSTHAN."] = "比较运算符键，例如 EQUALS 或 LESSTHAN。"
-- en: "Comparison result, or nil for an unknown operator."
L["Comparison result, or nil for an unknown operator."] = "比较结果；运算符未知时为 nil。"
-- en: "Comparison text retaining named Boolean alternative markup."
L["Comparison text retaining named Boolean alternative markup."] = "保留命名布尔备选标记的比较文本。"
-- en: "Complete matching class count, including zero, or nil when unavailable."
L["Complete matching class count, including zero, or nil when unavailable."] = "匹配职业的完整计数（包括零）；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Complete nonnegative observed count including zero, or nil when unavailable."
L["Complete nonnegative observed count including zero, or nil when unavailable."] = "完整的非负观测计数（包括零）；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Condition container supporting SetLayout, AddChild, SetUserData, SetWidth and DoLayout."
L["Condition container supporting SetLayout, AddChild, SetUserData, SetWidth and DoLayout."] = "支持 SetLayout、AddChild、SetUserData、SetWidth 和 DoLayout 的条件容器。"
-- en: "Condition value record containing spell, ranked and disabled fields; updated in place."
L["Condition value record containing spell, ranked and disabled fields; updated in place."] = "包含 spell、ranked 和 disabled 字段的条件值记录；会被原地更新。"
-- en: "Condition value record updated when a unit is chosen."
L["Condition value record updated when a unit is chosen."] = "选择单位时会被更新的条件值记录。"
-- en: "Configured unit selector; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Configured unit selector; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "已配置的单位选择器；使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 添加它。"
-- en: "Copy a table using tostring of each original key as the destination key. Values retain their original identities. Colliding stringified keys overwrite each other in unspecified pairs traversal order."
L["Copy a table using tostring of each original key as the destination key. Values retain their original identities. Colliding stringified keys overwrite each other in unspecified pairs traversal order."] = "复制一个表，以每个原始键的 tostring 结果作为目标键。值保留其原始身份。字符串化后相互冲突的键会按未指定的 pairs 遍历顺序相互覆盖。"
-- en: "Count all entries visited by pairs, including false values and sparse numeric or nonnumeric keys. A nil table has length zero."
L["Count all entries visited by pairs, including false values and sparse numeric or nonnumeric keys. A nil table has length zero."] = "统计 pairs 遍历到的所有条目，包括 false 值以及稀疏的数字键或非数字键。nil 表的长度为零。"
-- en: "Count matching class tokens in the current fixed roster. Read group membership first; when requested, raid membership selects raid1 through raid40 without a separate player fact. Solo and party paths read player first, then party1 through party4 when grouped. A complete known roster returns a count, including zero; any required unavailable fact returns nil with a reason. Complete observations share the evaluation-pass cache; no player class persists across passes. Archived raw callbacks retain their original load-time class separately."
L["Count matching class tokens in the current fixed roster. Read group membership first; when requested, raid membership selects raid1 through raid40 without a separate player fact. Solo and party paths read player first, then party1 through party4 when grouped. A complete known roster returns a count, including zero; any required unavailable fact returns nil with a reason. Complete observations share the evaluation-pass cache; no player class persists across passes. Archived raw callbacks retain their original load-time class separately."] = "统计当前固定名单中匹配的职业标识。先读取队伍成员身份；在要求时，团队成员身份会选择 raid1 到 raid40，而不单独读取玩家信息。单人和小队路径会先读取 player，组队时再读取 party1 到 party4。完整且已知的名单会返回计数（包括零）；任何所需信息不可用时返回 nil 及原因。完整的观测共享评估轮次缓存；玩家职业不会跨轮次保留。已归档的原始回调会单独保留其原有的加载时职业。"
-- en: "Count only GUID-keyed units already in the observed membership snapshot. Verify current token identity before using the published threat observer; known absent or reused tokens are excluded without adding replacements. Complete identity and threat observations share only the supplied evaluation cache, while membership is traversed fresh. Known nonenemy or optional nil threat is not counted; required unreadable, malformed or failed facts make the entire result unavailable. This does not enumerate a complete roster, apply a range filter or modify tracked records."
L["Count only GUID-keyed units already in the observed membership snapshot. Verify current token identity before using the published threat observer; known absent or reused tokens are excluded without adding replacements. Complete identity and threat observations share only the supplied evaluation cache, while membership is traversed fresh. Known nonenemy or optional nil threat is not counted; required unreadable, malformed or failed facts make the entire result unavailable. This does not enumerate a complete roster, apply a range filter or modify tracked records."] = "只统计已在观测成员快照中、以 GUID 为键的单位。在使用已发布的仇恨观测器之前，会先验证当前标识的身份；已知不存在或被重复使用的标识会被排除，且不会添加替代者。完整的身份和仇恨观测只共享所提供的评估缓存，而成员身份会重新遍历。已知的非敌人或可选的 nil 仇恨不计入；所需信息无法读取、格式错误或失败时，整个结果为不可用。这不会枚举完整的名单、应用距离筛选或修改被追踪的记录。"
-- en: "Create a condition field container with RM-owned List, Table and responsive spell-field layouts. It accepts registered native condition widgets; add children with AddChild and attach the group to the callback parent."
L["Create a condition field container with RM-owned List, Table and responsive spell-field layouts. It accepts registered native condition widgets; add children with AddChild and attach the group to the callback parent."] = "创建一个条件字段容器，使用 RM 自有的 List、Table 和自适应法术字段布局。它接受已注册的原生条件控件；使用 AddChild 添加子项，并将该组附加到回调的父级。"
-- en: "Create a configured unit selector bound to a condition value record. Returns the widget for the caller to add to the condition callback parent."
L["Create a configured unit selector bound to a condition value record. Returns the widget for the caller to add to the condition callback parent."] = "创建一个绑定到条件值记录的已配置单位选择器。返回该控件，由调用方将其添加到条件回调的父级。"
-- en: "Create a native boolean condition control. Configure SetLabel, SetValue, SetDisabled and OnValueChanged; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native boolean condition control. Configure SetLabel, SetValue, SetDisabled and OnValueChanged; add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "创建一个原生的布尔条件控件。配置 SetLabel、SetValue、SetDisabled 和 OnValueChanged；使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 添加它。"
-- en: "Create a native button using the shared condition widget lifecycle and workbench theme. SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure its label and interaction; OnClick receives the mouse button. Add it to the supplied parent."
L["Create a native button using the shared condition widget lifecycle and workbench theme. SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure its label and interaction; OnClick receives the mouse button. Add it to the supplied parent."] = "使用共享的条件控件生命周期和工作台主题创建一个原生按钮。SetText、SetDisabled 和 SetCallback 用于配置其标签和交互；OnClick 会收到所按的鼠标按键。将其添加到所提供的父级。"
-- en: "Create a native condition selector. SetList accepts key-to-label or key-to-entry maps; SetValue selects a key and OnValueChanged reports changes. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native condition selector. SetList accepts key-to-label or key-to-entry maps; SetValue selects a key and OnValueChanged reports changes. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "创建一个原生的条件选择器。SetList 接受键到标签或键到条目的映射；SetValue 选择一个键，OnValueChanged 报告变化。使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 添加它。"
-- en: "Create a native image control using the condition widget lifecycle. SetImage and SetImageSize choose the texture; SetText optionally adds a caption. OnClick, OnEnter and OnLeave use the shared callback contract. Add the control to the supplied parent."
L["Create a native image control using the condition widget lifecycle. SetImage and SetImageSize choose the texture; SetText optionally adds a caption. OnClick, OnEnter and OnLeave use the shared callback contract. Add the control to the supplied parent."] = "使用条件控件生命周期创建一个原生图像控件。SetImage 和 SetImageSize 用于选择材质；SetText 可选地添加说明文字。OnClick、OnEnter 和 OnLeave 使用共享的回调约定。将该控件添加到所提供的父级。"
-- en: "Create a native numeric condition input with a slider and typed numeric field. Configure SetSliderValues, SetValue, SetIsPercent and SetCallback; OnValueChanged reports committed values. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native numeric condition input with a slider and typed numeric field. Configure SetSliderValues, SetValue, SetIsPercent and SetCallback; OnValueChanged reports committed values. Add it with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "创建一个带有滑块和数字输入框的原生数值条件输入控件。配置 SetSliderValues、SetValue、SetIsPercent 和 SetCallback；OnValueChanged 报告已提交的值。使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 添加它。"
-- en: "Create a native position pad using the shared directional controls. OnOffsetChanged reports horizontal and vertical direction, whether Center was pressed, and the increment (one, or ten with Shift). SetDisabled controls interaction; add the pad to the supplied parent."
L["Create a native position pad using the shared directional controls. OnOffsetChanged reports horizontal and vertical direction, whether Center was pressed, and the increment (one, or ten with Shift). SetDisabled controls interaction; add the pad to the supplied parent."] = "使用共享的方向控件创建一个原生位置面板。OnOffsetChanged 报告水平和垂直方向、是否按下了“居中”，以及增量（一，或按住 Shift 时为十）。SetDisabled 控制交互；将该面板添加到所提供的父级。"
-- en: "Create a native text input using the condition widget contract. SetLabel, SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure it; OnEnterPressed commits text. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."
L["Create a native text input using the condition widget contract. SetLabel, SetText, SetDisabled and SetCallback configure it; OnEnterPressed commits text. Add it to the callback parent with parent:AddChild(widget)."] = "使用条件控件约定创建一个原生文本输入框。SetLabel、SetText、SetDisabled 和 SetCallback 用于配置它；OnEnterPressed 提交文本。使用 parent:AddChild(widget) 将其添加到回调的父级。"
-- en: "Create a shallow filtered copy despite the historical deepcopy name. Nested values retain their original identities and the source metatable is not copied. By default exclude keys listed among except values; invert true includes only listed keys. Nil input returns nil."
L["Create a shallow filtered copy despite the historical deepcopy name. Nested values retain their original identities and the source metatable is not copied. By default exclude keys listed among except values; invert true includes only listed keys. Nil input returns nil."] = "尽管历史上名为 deepcopy，它创建的是一个经过筛选的浅拷贝。嵌套的值保留其原始身份，且不会复制源表的元表。默认排除 except 值中列出的键；invert 为 true 时只包含列出的键。输入为 nil 时返回 nil。"
-- en: "Create a spell input with suggestions, validation and spell-link support for custom condition widgets. The update callback owns saving a chosen value; add the returned widget to the callback parent."
L["Create a spell input with suggestions, validation and spell-link support for custom condition widgets. The update callback owns saving a chosen value; add the returned widget to the callback parent."] = "为自定义条件控件创建一个带有建议、验证和法术链接支持的法术输入框。更新回调负责保存所选的值；将返回的控件添加到回调的父级。"
-- en: "Create a transient named condition summary. Use {name} for scalar values and {{positive|negative}} for predicate alternatives; prefix a primary alternative with !. Escape literal double braces as {{{{ and }}}}. Values are inserted literally without parsing their percent signs, links, colors or braces. Typed predicate values participate in primary selection. Templates, values and rendered text are bounded; malformed input renders a localized unavailable summary. This changes presentation only and runs no condition observations."
L["Create a transient named condition summary. Use {name} for scalar values and {{positive|negative}} for predicate alternatives; prefix a primary alternative with !. Escape literal double braces as {{{{ and }}}}. Values are inserted literally without parsing their percent signs, links, colors or braces. Typed predicate values participate in primary selection. Templates, values and rendered text are bounded; malformed input renders a localized unavailable summary. This changes presentation only and runs no condition observations."] = "创建一个临时的具名条件摘要。标量值使用 {name}，判断的正反两种措辞使用 {{positive|negative}}；在主要措辞前加上 ! 前缀。字面的双花括号请转义为 {{{{ 和 }}}}。值会按字面插入，不解析其中的百分号、链接、颜色或花括号。带类型的判断值会参与主要措辞的选择。模板、值和渲染后的文本都有长度上限；格式错误的输入会渲染为本地化的“不可用”摘要。这只改变呈现方式，不会运行任何条件观测。"
-- en: "Create a typed comparison predicate for a named condition phrase. Positive wording uses the original captured operator map and negative wording uses the current negated operator map. A primary predicate takes precedence over qualifiers; only the first eligible predicate negates. Unknown operators use the existing operator placeholder. This formats wording without comparing values or evaluating a condition."
L["Create a typed comparison predicate for a named condition phrase. Positive wording uses the original captured operator map and negative wording uses the current negated operator map. A primary predicate takes precedence over qualifiers; only the first eligible predicate negates. Unknown operators use the existing operator placeholder. This formats wording without comparing values or evaluating a condition."] = "为具名条件短语创建一个带类型的比较判断。肯定措辞使用原先捕获的运算符映射，否定措辞使用当前取反后的运算符映射。主要判断优先于限定词；只有第一个符合条件的判断会被取反。未知运算符使用现有的运算符占位符。这只格式化措辞，不比较值也不评估条件。"
-- en: "Create an iterator over a sorted snapshot of table keys. Default ordering compares keys; a custom order callback receives the original table and two keys. Values are read from the original table when each key is yielded. The legacy iterator ends when the next captured key is nil or false."
L["Create an iterator over a sorted snapshot of table keys. Default ordering compares keys; a custom order callback receives the original table and two keys. Values are read from the original table when each key is yielded. The legacy iterator ends when the next captured key is nil or false."] = "创建一个遍历表键排序快照的迭代器。默认按键排序；自定义排序回调会收到原始表和两个键。每次产出一个键时，值从原始表中读取。当下一个捕获的键为 nil 或 false 时，旧版迭代器结束。"
-- en: "Create native wrapping text that measures its height from its width and font. SetText, SetFont or SetFontObject configure its contents. Add it to the supplied parent so layout can track its measured height."
L["Create native wrapping text that measures its height from its width and font. SetText, SetFont or SetFontObject configure its contents. Add it to the supplied parent so layout can track its measured height."] = "创建原生的自动换行文本，根据其宽度和字体测量高度。SetText、SetFont 或 SetFontObject 用于配置其内容。将其添加到所提供的父级，以便布局能够跟踪其测得的高度。"
-- en: "Create native wrapping text with optional leading image and pointer callbacks. SetImage and SetImageSize configure the image; OnEnter, OnLeave and OnClick use the condition callback contract. Add it to the supplied parent; callbacks expire when its lease is released."
L["Create native wrapping text with optional leading image and pointer callbacks. SetImage and SetImageSize configure the image; OnEnter, OnLeave and OnClick use the condition callback contract. Add it to the supplied parent; callbacks expire when its lease is released."] = "创建原生的自动换行文本，可选择带有前置图像和指针回调。SetImage 和 SetImageSize 用于配置图像；OnEnter、OnLeave 和 OnClick 使用条件回调约定。将其添加到所提供的父级；其租用被释放时回调会失效。"
-- en: "Current evaluation time in seconds from GetTime(), normally evalStart."
L["Current evaluation time in seconds from GetTime(), normally evalStart."] = "当前评估时间，单位为秒，取自 GetTime()，通常为 evalStart。"
-- en: "Current positive visibility distance in yards; nil when unavailable."
L["Current positive visibility distance in yards; nil when unavailable."] = "当前的正可见距离，单位为码；不可用时为 nil。"
