L["Display lookup table."] = "显示查找表。"
-- en: "Estimate signed health change from weighted damage and healing history. Damage contributes a negative rate and healing a positive rate. Read the live profile window when no window is supplied, use the live clock and legacy rounding service, and preserve the existing weighting and rounded-age calculation. This helper does not validate or sanitize history, clamp timestamps, or guarantee finite results."
L["Estimate signed health change from weighted damage and healing history. Damage contributes a negative rate and healing a positive rate. Read the live profile window when no window is supplied, use the live clock and legacy rounding service, and preserve the existing weighting and rounded-age calculation. This helper does not validate or sanitize history, clamp timestamps, or guarantee finite results."] = "根据加权的伤害和治疗历史估算带符号的生命值变化。伤害贡献负速率，治疗贡献正速率。未提供窗口时读取实时配置文件中的窗口，使用实时时钟和旧版舍入服务，并保留现有的加权和舍入后时长计算。此辅助函数不会验证或清理历史，不会截断时间戳，也不保证结果有限。"
-- en: "Estimate time until selected health. Cache complete native identity and lazy scalar observations per evaluation pass, while provider, history, window, clock and forecast stay live. Exact target equality returns zero before history work. Preserve deliberate no-estimate false and initialized-zero results for zero or opposite rates; required invalid facts, overflow or 4096-unit work exhaustion are unavailable. Never mutate history or invent a partial estimate."
L["Estimate time until selected health. Cache complete native identity and lazy scalar observations per evaluation pass, while provider, history, window, clock and forecast stay live. Exact target equality returns zero before history work. Preserve deliberate no-estimate false and initialized-zero results for zero or opposite rates; required invalid facts, overflow or 4096-unit work exhaustion are unavailable. Never mutate history or invent a partial estimate."] = "估算距离达到所选生命值的时间。每个评估轮次缓存完整的原生身份和惰性标量观测，而提供者、历史、窗口、时钟和预测保持实时。目标完全相等时，会在处理历史之前返回零。对于零速率或反向速率，保留刻意设计的“无估算”false 结果和初始化的零结果；所需信息无效、溢出或 4096 单位工作量耗尽时为不可用。绝不修改历史或编造部分估算。"
-- en: "Evaluation cache, or nil to bypass caching."
L["Evaluation cache, or nil to bypass caching."] = "评估缓存；为 nil 时绕过缓存。"
