L["Evaluation-pass cache, or nil to observe identity directly. Resource mapping is resolved live on each invocation."] = "评估轮次缓存；为 nil 时直接观测身份。资源映射在每次调用时实时解析。"
-- en: "Evaluation-pass cache, or nil to observe identity directly. Successful player class observations may use the existing longterm identity cache; resource mapping remains live."
L["Evaluation-pass cache, or nil to observe identity directly. Successful player class observations may use the existing longterm identity cache; resource mapping remains live."] = "评估轮次缓存；为 nil 时直接观测身份。成功的玩家职业观测可以使用现有的长期身份缓存；资源映射保持实时。"
