L["Existing stored CREATURE key: BEAST, DRAGONKIN, DEMON, ELEMENTAL, GIANT, UNDEAD, HUMANOID, CRITTER, MECHANICAL, OTHER, TOTEM, NONCOMBAT_PET or GAS_CLUUD."] = "现有的已保存 CREATURE 键：BEAST、DRAGONKIN、DEMON、ELEMENTAL、GIANT、UNDEAD、HUMANOID、CRITTER、MECHANICAL、OTHER、TOTEM、NONCOMBAT_PET 或 GAS_CLUUD。"
