-- en: "Fresh readable record with active, optional name, remainingSeconds and interruptible. Remaining time is in seconds and is clamped to zero. An unavailable optional field has its own reason; it does not invalidate a readable active name."
L["Fresh readable record with active, optional name, remainingSeconds and interruptible. Remaining time is in seconds and is clamped to zero. An unavailable optional field has its own reason; it does not invalidate a readable active name."] = "全新的可读记录，包含 active、可选的 name、remainingSeconds 和 interruptible。剩余时间以秒为单位，并截断为不小于零。不可用的可选字段有其自己的原因；它不会使可读的 active 名称失效。"
