L["Fresh readable record with exists and, when present, powerType and finite current quantity. Requested maximum is finite and nonnegative. Quantities may be fractional; current-mode current may be signed."] = "全新的可读记录，包含 exists，存在时还包含 powerType 和有限的当前数量。请求的最大值为有限的非负数。数量可以是小数；current 模式下的当前值可以带符号。"
-- en: "Fresh readable record with finite nonnegative speed, or nil when unavailable."
L["Fresh readable record with finite nonnegative speed, or nil when unavailable."] = "全新的可读记录，包含有限的非负速度；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Function or global function name to call."
L["Function or global function name to call."] = "要调用的函数或全局函数名称。"
-- en: "History record with newest-first damage and heals arrays of time/value entries. Falsy history returns only zero without reading the clock."
L["History record with newest-first damage and heals arrays of time/value entries. Falsy history returns only zero without reading the clock."] = "历史记录，包含以最新者在前的伤害和治疗数组，元素为时间/数值条目。为假值的历史只返回零，不会读取时钟。"
-- en: "Identifier-keyed scalar values or typed predicates. Strings, finite numbers and booleans are supported; referenced slots must be present. Values are captured when the phrase is created."
L["Identifier-keyed scalar values or typed predicates. Strings, finite numbers and booleans are supported; referenced slots must be present. Values are captured when the phrase is created."] = "以标识符为键的标量值或带类型的判断。支持字符串、有限数字和布尔值；被引用的栏位必须存在。值在创建短语时被捕获。"
-- en: "Insert each value visited by ipairs at its corresponding leading index in the destination array. Existing entries shift after the inserted prefix; traversal stops at the first missing source index."
L["Insert each value visited by ipairs at its corresponding leading index in the destination array. Existing entries shift after the inserted prefix; traversal stops at the first missing source index."] = "将 ipairs 遍历到的每个值插入到目标数组中对应的开头索引处。现有条目会移到插入的前缀之后；遍历在第一个缺失的源索引处停止。"
-- en: "Integral RM statistic selector 1..5, or 6 for effective armor."
L["Integral RM statistic selector 1..5, or 6 for effective armor."] = "整数形式的 RM 属性选择器 1..5，或 6 表示有效护甲。"
-- en: "Iterator yielding a captured key and its current table value, or no values when exhausted."
L["Iterator yielding a captured key and its current table value, or no values when exhausted."] = "产出一个捕获的键及其当前表值的迭代器；耗尽时不产出任何值。"
-- en: "Key to look up."
L["Key to look up."] = "要查找的键。"
-- en: "Known active count from zero through the RM scan budget, or nil when unavailable."
L["Known active count from zero through the RM scan budget, or nil when unavailable."] = "已知的活跃计数，范围为零到 RM 的扫描预算；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Known nonempty role string, false for known absent unit, or nil when unavailable."
L["Known nonempty role string, false for known absent unit, or nil when unavailable."] = "已知的非空职责字符串；已知单位不存在时为 false，不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Known nonempty role string, or nil when unavailable."
L["Known nonempty role string, or nil when unavailable."] = "已知的非空职责字符串；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Known unit presence or absence; nil when the required observation is unavailable."
L["Known unit presence or absence; nil when the required observation is unavailable."] = "已知的单位存在或不存在；所需观测不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Larger rounded stream age in seconds, not a sample count or proof of continuous observation. Omitted when history is falsy."
L["Larger rounded stream age in seconds, not a sample count or proof of continuous observation. Omitted when history is falsy."] = "较大的舍入后数据流时长（秒），并非样本数量，也不能证明是连续观测。历史为假值时省略。"
-- en: "Left operand; use numbers for ordering and divisibility."
L["Left operand; use numbers for ordering and divisibility."] = "左操作数；排序和整除请使用数字。"
-- en: "Literal prefix, including an empty prefix."
L["Literal prefix, including an empty prefix."] = "字面前缀，可以为空前缀。"
-- en: "Literal suffix, including an empty suffix."
L["Literal suffix, including an empty suffix."] = "字面后缀，可以为空后缀。"
-- en: "Live selected talent-group argument, forwarded unchanged as one argument after readability checking."
L["Live selected talent-group argument, forwarded unchanged as one argument after readability checking."] = "实时的所选天赋组参数，经可读性检查后作为单个参数原样转发。"
-- en: "Localized complete sentence with named slots and optional explicit predicate alternatives."
L["Localized complete sentence with named slots and optional explicit predicate alternatives."] = "带有命名栏位和可选的显式判断备选项的本地化完整句子。"
-- en: "Look up a table key for display, preserving non-nil results; invalid tables, missing keys and nil keys use nullable placeholder text."
L["Look up a table key for display, preserving non-nil results; invalid tables, missing keys and nil keys use nullable placeholder text."] = "查找表中的键用于显示，保留非 nil 的结果；无效的表、缺失的键和 nil 键会使用可空占位文本。"
-- en: "Lookup key."
L["Lookup key."] = "查找键。"
-- en: "Lua pattern character-class separator, default %s for whitespace."
L["Lua pattern character-class separator, default %s for whitespace."] = "Lua 模式的字符类分隔符，默认为 %s，表示空白字符。"
-- en: "Mark the positive wording as the primary named alternative."
L["Mark the positive wording as the primary named alternative."] = "将肯定措辞标记为主要的命名备选项。"
-- en: "Matching key, including a false key, or nil when no match exists."
L["Matching key, including a false key, or nil when no match exists."] = "匹配的键（包括 false 键）；不存在匹配时为 nil。"
-- en: "Missing-value display text; omitted uses the localized value placeholder."
L["Missing-value display text; omitted uses the localized value placeholder."] = "缺失值的显示文本；省略时使用本地化的值占位符。"
-- en: "Native button with label, disabled state and lease-protected callbacks."
L["Native button with label, disabled state and lease-protected callbacks."] = "带有标签、禁用状态和受租用保护回调的原生按钮。"
-- en: "Native directional pad with center reset and lease-protected callbacks."
L["Native directional pad with center reset and lease-protected callbacks."] = "带有居中重置和受租用保护回调的原生方向面板。"
-- en: "Native image control with label, texture, disabled state and callbacks."
L["Native image control with label, texture, disabled state and callbacks."] = "带有标签、材质、禁用状态和回调的原生图像控件。"
-- en: "Native interactive text and image control with measured height and disabled state."
L["Native interactive text and image control with measured height and disabled state."] = "带有测量高度和禁用状态的原生交互式文本和图像控件。"
-- en: "Native one-based integral active-row index within the 256-row RM scan budget."
L["Native one-based integral active-row index within the 256-row RM scan budget."] = "在 RM 256 行扫描预算内、从 1 开始的原生整数活跃行索引。"
-- en: "Native wrapping text control with font, color and alignment methods."
L["Native wrapping text control with font, color and alignment methods."] = "带有字体、颜色和对齐方法的原生自动换行文本控件。"
-- en: "New shallow filtered table, or nil for nil input."
L["New shallow filtered table, or nil for nil input."] = "新的经过筛选的浅拷贝表；输入为 nil 时为 nil。"
-- en: "New table with stringified keys and unchanged values."
L["New table with stringified keys and unchanged values."] = "键被字符串化、值保持不变的新表。"
-- en: "Newest-first health snapshots containing time, value and max. Falsy input returns only zero without reading the clock."
L["Newest-first health snapshots containing time, value and max. Falsy input returns only zero without reading the clock."] = "以最新者在前的生命值快照，包含 time、value 和 max。为假值的输入只返回零，不会读取时钟。"
-- en: "No return values. The destination array is modified in place."
L["No return values. The destination array is modified in place."] = "没有返回值。目标数组会被原地修改。"
-- en: "No return values. The supplied table is modified in place."
L["No return values. The supplied table is modified in place."] = "没有返回值。所提供的表会被原地修改。"
-- en: "Nonempty class filename token to count; no class-token whitelist is applied."
L["Nonempty class filename token to count; no class-token whitelist is applied."] = "要统计的非空职业文件名标识；不应用职业标识白名单。"
-- en: "Nonempty historical school key for resist/immune; unused for runner."
L["Nonempty historical school key for resist/immune; unused for runner."] = "用于 resist/immune 的非空历史法术类型键；runner 不使用。"
-- en: "Normalized bounded socket snapshot with slots and complete, or nil when the query is unavailable."
L["Normalized bounded socket snapshot with slots and complete, or nil when the query is unavailable."] = "规范化的有限插槽快照，包含 slots 和 complete；查询不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Normalized requested subject with finite timeRemaining or timeRemainingReason; nil when the required row or subject is unavailable."
L["Normalized requested subject with finite timeRemaining or timeRemainingReason; nil when the required row or subject is unavailable."] = "规范化的所请求主题，包含有限的 timeRemaining 或 timeRemainingReason；所需的行或主题不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Number of entries visited."
L["Number of entries visited."] = "遍历到的条目数量。"
-- en: "Number or string to inspect; other types do not match."
L["Number or string to inspect; other types do not match."] = "要检查的数字或字符串；其他类型不匹配。"
-- en: "Numeric widget supporting slider bounds, percent display and pending-edit validation."
L["Numeric widget supporting slider bounds, percent display and pending-edit validation."] = "支持滑块范围、百分比显示和待处理编辑验证的数值控件。"
-- en: "Observation kind: cast or channel. These use different native interruptibility tuple positions."
L["Observation kind: cast or channel. These use different native interruptibility tuple positions."] = "观测种类：cast 或 channel。它们使用原生可打断元组中的不同位置。"
-- en: "Observation, history, work-limit or arithmetic availability reason."
L["Observation, history, work-limit or arithmetic availability reason."] = "观测、历史、工作量上限或运算的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Observe a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for a needed health forecast. Require readability and a finite number; preserve signed and fractional values without adding a monotonic, integral or nonnegative restriction. No clock cache or extra native query is used."
L["Observe a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for a needed health forecast. Require readability and a finite number; preserve signed and fractional values without adding a monotonic, integral or nonnegative restriction. No clock cache or extra native query is used."] = "为所需的生命值预测重新观测一次受保护的无参数 GetTime。要求结果可读且为有限数字；保留带符号和小数值，不额外加入单调、整数或非负的限制。不使用时钟缓存或额外的原生查询。"
-- en: "Observe a readable raw unit level on known clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false; present units require a positive finite integer UnitLevel. Unknown boss levels, missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not use effective or scaled levels."
L["Observe a readable raw unit level on known clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false; present units require a positive finite integer UnitLevel. Unknown boss levels, missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not use effective or scaled levels."] = "在已知的客户端上观测可读的原始单位等级。可读且不存在的单位返回 exists=false；存在的单位要求 UnitLevel 为正的有限整数。未知的首领等级，以及缺失、失败、受限或格式错误的观测会返回 nil 及原因。这不使用有效等级或缩放后的等级。"
-- en: "Observe a selected unit role on probe-policy clients without issuing inspection requests. Known unit absence returns false. Prefer the callable modern inspection API, with legacy fallback only when that callable is absent; a selected failure never falls through. Require a positive finite integral specialization ID and consume only role return five from the exact one-argument GetSpecializationInfoByID call. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed required facts are unavailable; readable nonempty future role strings remain exact."
L["Observe a selected unit role on probe-policy clients without issuing inspection requests. Known unit absence returns false. Prefer the callable modern inspection API, with legacy fallback only when that callable is absent; a selected failure never falls through. Require a positive finite integral specialization ID and consume only role return five from the exact one-argument GetSpecializationInfoByID call. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed required facts are unavailable; readable nonempty future role strings remain exact."] = "在探测策略客户端上观测所选单位的职责，不发出观察请求。已知单位不存在时返回 false。优先使用可调用的现代观察 API，仅当它不可调用时才回退到旧版；所选 API 失败时绝不会回退。要求专精 ID 为正的有限整数，并且只使用确切的单参数 GetSpecializationInfoByID 调用的第五个返回值（职责）。所需信息缺失、失败、受限或格式错误时为不可用；可读的非空未来职责字符串保持原样。"
-- en: "Observe a unit casting or channeling on supported readable clients. A readable inactive result returns active=false. Active records contain name and independently available remainingSeconds and interruptible fields, with remainingReason or interruptibleReason when an optional field is unavailable. Missing, failed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."
L["Observe a unit casting or channeling on supported readable clients. A readable inactive result returns active=false. Active records contain name and independently available remainingSeconds and interruptible fields, with remainingReason or interruptibleReason when an optional field is unavailable. Missing, failed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."] = "在受支持且可读的客户端上观测单位的施法或引导。可读的非活跃结果返回 active=false。活跃记录包含 name，以及各自独立可用的 remainingSeconds 和 interruptible 字段；当可选字段不可用时附带 remainingReason 或 interruptibleReason。缺失、失败或受限的观测会返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Observe creature identity from native UnitCreatureType return two on probe-policy clients. Check exact UnitExists(unit) first; readable false returns false without requiring or calling creature metadata. A present unit requires a readable finite numeric ID; the unused localized name does not affect availability. Preserve signed, fractional, zero and future finite IDs as known values. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed required facts return nil with a reason. No creature enumeration, translated caption comparison or longterm cache is added."
L["Observe creature identity from native UnitCreatureType return two on probe-policy clients. Check exact UnitExists(unit) first; readable false returns false without requiring or calling creature metadata. A present unit requires a readable finite numeric ID; the unused localized name does not affect availability. Preserve signed, fractional, zero and future finite IDs as known values. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed required facts return nil with a reason. No creature enumeration, translated caption comparison or longterm cache is added."] = "在探测策略客户端上，从原生 UnitCreatureType 的第二个返回值观测生物身份。先检查确切的 UnitExists(unit)；可读的 false 会直接返回 false，不需要也不调用生物元数据。存在的单位要求可读的有限数字 ID；未使用的本地化名称不影响可用性。带符号、小数、零以及未来的有限 ID 都会作为已知值保留。所需信息缺失、失败、为 nil、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。不会添加生物枚举、翻译标题比较或长期缓存。"
-- en: "Observe death or ghost state, or friendliness to the player, for the exact selected unit on probe-policy clients. A missing, failed, restricted or malformed required observation is unavailable. Unit absence is unavailable rather than a negative match, including under NOT. No cross-poll state is retained."
L["Observe death or ghost state, or friendliness to the player, for the exact selected unit on probe-policy clients. A missing, failed, restricted or malformed required observation is unavailable. Unit absence is unavailable rather than a negative match, including under NOT. No cross-poll state is retained."] = "在探测策略客户端上，观测确切的所选单位是否死亡或处于灵魂状态，或是否对玩家友好。所需观测缺失、失败、受限或格式错误时为不可用。单位不存在时为不可用，而不是否定匹配，在 NOT 下同样如此。不会保留跨轮询的状态。"
-- en: "Observe exact pet existence and optionally its formatted GetUnitName display name. Presence-only queries never require name data. Known absence skips the name query. Present pets require a readable nonempty name only when requested; required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. The display helper is called with its single original pet argument, without UnitName fallback or inferred bar, health or ability state."
L["Observe exact pet existence and optionally its formatted GetUnitName display name. Presence-only queries never require name data. Known absence skips the name query. Present pets require a readable nonempty name only when requested; required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. The display helper is called with its single original pet argument, without UnitName fallback or inferred bar, health or ability state."] = "观测宠物是否确切存在，并可选地观测其经 GetUnitName 格式化的显示名称。仅查询存在性时从不需要名称数据。已知不存在时会跳过名称查询。仅在请求时，存在的宠物才需要可读的非空名称；所需观测缺失、失败、为 nil、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。显示辅助函数只以原有的单个宠物参数调用，不回退到 UnitName，也不推断动作条、生命值或技能状态。"
-- en: "Observe exact selected-unit existence and optionally its class filename for point-resource conditions. Known absence returns exists=false without reading class. Present units require only UnitClass return two when requested; unused localized names and IDs do not affect availability. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. This does not select a resource or cache identity."
L["Observe exact selected-unit existence and optionally its class filename for point-resource conditions. Known absence returns exists=false without reading class. Present units require only UnitClass return two when requested; unused localized names and IDs do not affect availability. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. This does not select a resource or cache identity."] = "为点数资源条件观测确切的所选单位是否存在，并可选地观测其职业文件名。已知不存在时返回 exists=false，不读取职业。存在的单位只在请求时需要 UnitClass 的第二个返回值；未使用的本地化名称和 ID 不影响可用性。所需观测缺失、失败、受限或格式错误时保持为不可用。这不会选择资源或缓存身份。"
-- en: "Observe explicit mana or the current raw power resource on supported readable clients. Select resource identities from the live PowerType enum; explicit mana never falls back to the current bar. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. Current-mode quantities preserve signed native resources; explicit mana is nonnegative. Request maximum only when needed; percentage consumers must require a positive maximum."
L["Observe explicit mana or the current raw power resource on supported readable clients. Select resource identities from the live PowerType enum; explicit mana never falls back to the current bar. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. Current-mode quantities preserve signed native resources; explicit mana is nonnegative. Request maximum only when needed; percentage consumers must require a positive maximum."] = "在受支持且可读的客户端上观测显式的法力值或当前的原始能量资源。资源身份从实时的 PowerType 枚举中选择；显式法力值绝不会回退到当前能量条。已知不存在时返回 exists=false；缺失、失败、受限或格式错误的观测会返回 nil 及原因。current 模式下的数量保留带符号的原生资源；显式法力值为非负。仅在需要时请求最大值；百分比的使用者必须要求最大值为正。"
-- en: "Observe glyph sockets on verified Wrath, Cata and Mists client layouts. Returns slots and a complete flag. Each slot has active=false when known locked or empty, active=true plus spellID when occupied, or nil active plus reason when unavailable. Unknown layouts and failed count queries return nil with a reason. This does not compare item names or prove exact item-to-spell identity."
L["Observe glyph sockets on verified Wrath, Cata and Mists client layouts. Returns slots and a complete flag. Each slot has active=false when known locked or empty, active=true plus spellID when occupied, or nil active plus reason when unavailable. Unknown layouts and failed count queries return nil with a reason. This does not compare item names or prove exact item-to-spell identity."] = "在已验证的巫妖王之怒、大地的裂变和熊猫人之谜客户端布局上观测雕文插槽。返回 slots 和 complete 标记。每个插槽在已知锁定或为空时为 active=false，被占用时为 active=true 并附带 spellID，不可用时 active 为 nil 并附带原因。未知布局和失败的数量查询会返回 nil 及原因。这不会比较物品名称，也不能证明物品与法术身份的确切对应。"
-- en: "Observe one consumed native unit metadata field after checking UnitExists: class uses UnitClass return two, creature uses the localized UnitCreatureType name, and classification uses UnitClassification. A readable absent unit returns false without querying metadata. Unused tuple fields do not affect availability; a required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed value returns nil with a reason. No player class, GUID, enum or translation inference is added."
L["Observe one consumed native unit metadata field after checking UnitExists: class uses UnitClass return two, creature uses the localized UnitCreatureType name, and classification uses UnitClassification. A readable absent unit returns false without querying metadata. Unused tuple fields do not affect availability; a required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed value returns nil with a reason. No player class, GUID, enum or translation inference is added."] = "在检查 UnitExists 后观测一个所使用的原生单位元数据字段：class 使用 UnitClass 的第二个返回值，creature 使用本地化的 UnitCreatureType 名称，classification 使用 UnitClassification。可读且不存在的单位返回 false，不查询元数据。未使用的元组字段不影响可用性；所需的值缺失、失败、为 nil、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。不会添加玩家职业、GUID、枚举或翻译推断。"
-- en: "Observe one current unit flag: combat uses UnitAffectingCombat, enemy uses UnitIsEnemy with player as the first unit, and pvp uses UnitIsPVP. A readable absent unit returns false without querying the flag. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This preserves the exact selected unit and does not infer friendliness, attackability or other unit states."
L["Observe one current unit flag: combat uses UnitAffectingCombat, enemy uses UnitIsEnemy with player as the first unit, and pvp uses UnitIsPVP. A readable absent unit returns false without querying the flag. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This preserves the exact selected unit and does not infer friendliness, attackability or other unit states."] = "观测一个当前的单位标记：combat 使用 UnitAffectingCombat，enemy 使用以 player 为第一个单位的 UnitIsEnemy，pvp 使用 UnitIsPVP。可读且不存在的单位返回 false，不查询该标记。所需观测缺失、失败、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。这会保留确切的所选单位，不推断友好、可攻击或其他单位状态。"
-- en: "Observe one exact native rune slot using GetRuneType with its single index argument. Require a readable finite positive integral type; known future numeric types remain distinct from the selected type, and Death is an exact type rather than a wildcard. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. No class, unit, count or inferred base-rune query is added."
L["Observe one exact native rune slot using GetRuneType with its single index argument. Require a readable finite positive integral type; known future numeric types remain distinct from the selected type, and Death is an exact type rather than a wildcard. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. No class, unit, count or inferred base-rune query is added."] = "使用只带单个索引参数的 GetRuneType 观测一个确切的原生符文栏位。要求类型可读且为正的有限整数；已知的未来数字类型与所选类型保持区分，死亡符文是一个确切的类型而不是通配符。缺失、失败、受限或格式错误的观测保持为不可用。不会添加职业、单位、数量或推断基础符文的查询。"
-- en: "Observe one independent zero-argument player flag: stealthed uses IsStealthed, control uses HasFullControl, and outdoors uses IsOutdoors. Readable true and false retain their meanings. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed data returns nil with a reason. No existence, instance or ability-usability inference is added."
L["Observe one independent zero-argument player flag: stealthed uses IsStealthed, control uses HasFullControl, and outdoors uses IsOutdoors. Readable true and false retain their meanings. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed data returns nil with a reason. No existence, instance or ability-usability inference is added."] = "观测一个独立的无参数玩家标记：stealthed 使用 IsStealthed，control 使用 HasFullControl，outdoors 使用 IsOutdoors。可读的 true 和 false 保留其含义。所需数据缺失、失败、为 nil、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。不会添加存在性、副本或技能可用性的推断。"
-- en: "Observe one protected zero-argument IsInInstance tuple. Required readable Boolean membership is independent of the type field: known outside returns without interpreting the unused type; inside returns a readable string type or an instanceTypeReason when that secondary field is unavailable. Callers testing outside need only membership; inside type comparisons must check the secondary reason. No outdoors, zone or unit inference is added."
L["Observe one protected zero-argument IsInInstance tuple. Required readable Boolean membership is independent of the type field: known outside returns without interpreting the unused type; inside returns a readable string type or an instanceTypeReason when that secondary field is unavailable. Callers testing outside need only membership; inside type comparisons must check the secondary reason. No outdoors, zone or unit inference is added."] = "观测一个受保护的无参数 IsInInstance 元组。所需的可读布尔成员值与类型字段无关：已知在副本外时直接返回，不解释未使用的类型；在副本内时返回可读的字符串类型，或在该次要字段不可用时返回 instanceTypeReason。检测是否在副本外的调用方只需要成员值；在副本内比较类型时必须检查次要原因。不会添加户外、区域或单位推断。"
-- en: "Observe ordered selected-unit existence, hostility from player, then the player threat status on that unit. Known absence, nonenemy and a successfully read nil threat status return false, preserving the no-threat predicate. Finite status numbers including zero retain their original comparison meaning. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed facts return nil with a reason. No attackability, death, combat or vehicle inference is added."
L["Observe ordered selected-unit existence, hostility from player, then the player threat status on that unit. Known absence, nonenemy and a successfully read nil threat status return false, preserving the no-threat predicate. Finite status numbers including zero retain their original comparison meaning. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed facts return nil with a reason. No attackability, death, combat or vehicle inference is added."] = "依次观测所选单位是否存在、是否与玩家敌对，然后观测玩家在该单位上的仇恨状态。已知不存在、非敌人以及成功读取到的 nil 仇恨状态返回 false，以保留“无仇恨”判断。包括零在内的有限状态数值保留其原有的比较含义。所需信息缺失、失败、为 nil、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。不会添加可攻击、死亡、战斗或载具的推断。"
-- en: "Observe readable current health and optionally maximum health on supported clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason; they do not establish an absent unit or a health value."
L["Observe readable current health and optionally maximum health on supported clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason; they do not establish an absent unit or a health value."] = "在受支持的客户端上观测可读的当前生命值，并可选地观测最大生命值。可读且不存在的单位返回 exists=false。缺失、失败、受限或格式错误的观测会返回 nil 及原因；它们不能证明单位不存在或得出生命值。"
-- en: "Observe the current player form with one protected zero-argument GetShapeshiftForm call. Preserve every readable finite numeric result, including zero, signed and fractional values; no stronger native index domain is inferred. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. No form count, class, spell ID, unit or optional argument is added."
L["Observe the current player form with one protected zero-argument GetShapeshiftForm call. Preserve every readable finite numeric result, including zero, signed and fractional values; no stronger native index domain is inferred. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. No form count, class, spell ID, unit or optional argument is added."] = "使用一次受保护的无参数 GetShapeshiftForm 调用观测玩家当前的形态。保留每个可读的有限数字结果，包括零、带符号和小数值；不会推断更严格的原生索引范围。缺失、失败、为 nil、受限或非有限的数据保持为不可用。不会添加形态数量、职业、法术 ID、单位或可选参数。"
-- en: "Observe the effective statistic from native return two only. On probe-policy clients query exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitStat(unit,stat) for selector 1..5 or UnitArmor(unit) for selector 6. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite required facts return nil. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero values; ignore all unused tuple fields. The 1..6 route is an RM selector policy, not a native value-domain limit."
L["Observe the effective statistic from native return two only. On probe-policy clients query exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitStat(unit,stat) for selector 1..5 or UnitArmor(unit) for selector 6. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite required facts return nil. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero values; ignore all unused tuple fields. The 1..6 route is an RM selector policy, not a native value-domain limit."] = "只从原生的第二个返回值观测有效属性。在探测策略客户端上，先查询确切的 UnitExists(unit)，然后对选择器 1..5 查询 UnitStat(unit,stat)，或对选择器 6 查询 UnitArmor(unit)。已知不存在时返回 exists=false；所需信息缺失、失败、受限或非有限时返回 nil。保留有限的带符号、小数和零值；忽略所有未使用的元组字段。1..6 的路由是 RM 的选择器策略，而非原生值域的限制。"
-- en: "Observe the explicitly selected TBC player combo transport. Current uses exactly GetComboPoints(player,target); maximum uses UnitPowerMax(player,powerType) with the original selector. Other families are unavailable here and must use their existing point-power observer. Preserve readable finite signed, fractional and zero values. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed data remains unavailable; a failed chosen combo query never falls back to UnitPower. This observes no other actor and adds no cache."
L["Observe the explicitly selected TBC player combo transport. Current uses exactly GetComboPoints(player,target); maximum uses UnitPowerMax(player,powerType) with the original selector. Other families are unavailable here and must use their existing point-power observer. Preserve readable finite signed, fractional and zero values. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed data remains unavailable; a failed chosen combo query never falls back to UnitPower. This observes no other actor and adds no cache."] = "观测显式选择的 TBC 玩家连击点传输方式。current 只使用 GetComboPoints(player,target)；maximum 使用带原始选择器的 UnitPowerMax(player,powerType)。其他客户端系列在此不可用，必须使用其现有的点数能量观测器。保留可读的有限带符号、小数和零值。缺失、失败、受限或格式错误的数据保持为不可用；所选的连击点查询失败时绝不会回退到 UnitPower。这不会观测其他角色，也不会添加缓存。"
-- en: "Observe the first role result of the exact legacy GetTalentGroupRole(group) dot call on probe-policy clients. Forward the readable selected group unchanged, including nil as one argument; do not infer group bounds, substitute another API or query a player unit. The complete legacy primary declaration is not established. Missing, failed, restricted, empty or malformed role data is unavailable; readable nonempty future strings remain exact."
L["Observe the first role result of the exact legacy GetTalentGroupRole(group) dot call on probe-policy clients. Forward the readable selected group unchanged, including nil as one argument; do not infer group bounds, substitute another API or query a player unit. The complete legacy primary declaration is not established. Missing, failed, restricted, empty or malformed role data is unavailable; readable nonempty future strings remain exact."] = "在探测策略客户端上，观测确切的旧版 GetTalentGroupRole(group) 点号调用的第一个职责结果。将可读的所选天赋组原样转发，包括将 nil 作为一个参数；不推断天赋组范围、不替换为其他 API，也不查询玩家单位。完整的旧版主要声明并未成立。职责数据缺失、失败、受限、为空或格式错误时为不可用；可读的非空未来字符串保持原样。"
-- en: "Observe the first zone PvP classification result with one protected zero-argument dot call. Prefer callable C_PvP.GetZonePVPInfo and use the global helper only when the modern callable is absent. A successful nil or no returned values produces a known empty record; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. Readable empty and future strings retain their exact meaning, and unused return fields do not determine availability. Never switch backends after a modern result or failure."
L["Observe the first zone PvP classification result with one protected zero-argument dot call. Prefer callable C_PvP.GetZonePVPInfo and use the global helper only when the modern callable is absent. A successful nil or no returned values produces a known empty record; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. Readable empty and future strings retain their exact meaning, and unused return fields do not determine availability. Never switch backends after a modern result or failure."] = "使用一次受保护的无参数点号调用，观测区域 PvP 分类的第一个结果。优先使用可调用的 C_PvP.GetZonePVPInfo，仅当现代 API 不可调用时才使用全局辅助函数。成功返回 nil 或没有返回值时，会产生一个已知的空记录；缺失、失败、受限或格式错误的观测保持为不可用。可读的空字符串和未来字符串保留其确切含义，未使用的返回字段不决定可用性。在现代 API 返回结果或失败后，绝不切换后端。"
-- en: "Observe the player current movement speed on supported readable clients. This queries GetUnitSpeed for player only, without testing another unit or redirecting vehicle ownership. Zero means stationary; positive finite fractional speeds remain valid. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason."
L["Observe the player current movement speed on supported readable clients. This queries GetUnitSpeed for player only, without testing another unit or redirecting vehicle ownership. Zero means stationary; positive finite fractional speeds remain valid. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason."] = "在受支持且可读的客户端上观测玩家当前的移动速度。这只针对 player 查询 GetUnitSpeed，不检测其他单位，也不重定向载具所有权。零表示静止；正的有限小数速度仍然有效。缺失、失败、受限或格式错误的观测会返回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Observe unit presence on identified client families. Pass the selected unit unchanged to one protected UnitExists call. Preserve readable true and false; missing, failed, restricted, nil or malformed required observations return nil with a reason. No identity, visibility, range or combat-state query is added."
L["Observe unit presence on identified client families. Pass the selected unit unchanged to one protected UnitExists call. Preserve readable true and false; missing, failed, restricted, nil or malformed required observations return nil with a reason. No identity, visibility, range or combat-state query is added."] = "在已识别的客户端系列上观测单位的存在性。将所选单位原样传给一次受保护的 UnitExists 调用。保留可读的 true 和 false；所需观测缺失、失败、受限、为 nil 或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。不会添加身份、可见性、距离或战斗状态的查询。"
-- en: "Observe whether the player can attack a selected unit that is not dead, using the exact UnitExists, UnitCanAttack and UnitIsDead predicates. Known absence or a readable false attack result returns false without querying death. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not test ghosts, range, hostility or ability usability, and does not redirect unit ownership."
L["Observe whether the player can attack a selected unit that is not dead, using the exact UnitExists, UnitCanAttack and UnitIsDead predicates. Known absence or a readable false attack result returns false without querying death. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not test ghosts, range, hostility or ability usability, and does not redirect unit ownership."] = "使用确切的 UnitExists、UnitCanAttack 和 UnitIsDead 判断，观测玩家是否可以攻击一个未死亡的所选单位。已知不存在或可读的不可攻击结果会返回 false，不查询死亡状态。所需观测缺失、失败、受限或格式错误时返回 nil 及原因。这不检测灵魂状态、距离、敌对状态或技能可用性，也不重定向单位所有权。"
-- en: "Observed class filename string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when unavailable."
L["Observed class filename string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when unavailable."] = "观测到的职业文件名字符串；已知单位不存在时为 false，不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Observed membership, or nil when unavailable."
L["Observed membership, or nil when unavailable."] = "观测到的成员身份；不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "On a selected resource only, target-combo for the explicit TBC player fallback or power for the existing selected-unit transport."
L["On a selected resource only, target-combo for the explicit TBC player fallback or power for the existing selected-unit transport."] = "仅限所选资源：target-combo 用于显式的 TBC 玩家后备，power 用于现有的所选单位传输方式。"
-- en: "On probe-policy clients observe exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitGUID(unit) only for a present unit. Known absence is false. Present identity requires a readable nonempty GUID; missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts are unavailable. No health, provider or extra-unit observation is added."
L["On probe-policy clients observe exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitGUID(unit) only for a present unit. Known absence is false. Present identity requires a readable nonempty GUID; missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts are unavailable. No health, provider or extra-unit observation is added."] = "在探测策略客户端上观测确切的 UnitExists(unit)，然后仅对存在的单位观测 UnitGUID(unit)。已知不存在时为 false。存在的身份要求可读的非空 GUID；所需信息缺失、失败、格式错误或受限时为不可用。不会添加生命值、提供者或额外单位的观测。"
-- en: "One of class, creature or classification; other metadata kinds are unsupported."
L["One of class, creature or classification; other metadata kinds are unsupported."] = "class、creature 或 classification 之一；不支持其他元数据种类。"
-- en: "One of combat, enemy or pvp; other flag kinds are not supported."
L["One of combat, enemy or pvp; other flag kinds are not supported."] = "combat、enemy 或 pvp 之一；不支持其他标记种类。"
-- en: "One of stealthed, control or outdoors; no other predicate is invoked."
L["One of stealthed, control or outdoors; no other predicate is invoked."] = "stealthed、control 或 outdoors 之一；不会调用其他判断。"
