L["Optional positive class ID; nil queries the current player class under protection."] = "可选的正数职业 ID；为 nil 时会在保护下查询当前玩家的职业。"
-- en: "Original explicit readable finite nonnegative integer combo-resource selector, including zero; retained for the maximum query."
L["Original explicit readable finite nonnegative integer combo-resource selector, including zero; retained for the maximum query."] = "原始的显式、可读、有限的非负整数连击资源选择器（包括零）；保留用于最大值查询。"
-- en: "Original non-nil lookup result, or a colored placeholder string."
L["Original non-nil lookup result, or a colored placeholder string."] = "原始的非 nil 查找结果，或一个带颜色的占位字符串。"
