L["Partial record containing ready or readyReason, start or startReason, and duration or durationReason; nil only when the query itself is unavailable."] = "部分记录，包含 ready 或 readyReason、start 或 startReason，以及 duration 或 durationReason；仅当查询本身不可用时为 nil。"
-- en: "Pet observation with Boolean exists and, for a requested present pet, name; nil when required data is unavailable."
L["Pet observation with Boolean exists and, for a requested present pet, name; nil when required data is unavailable."] = "宠物观测，包含布尔值 exists，对于请求的存在的宠物还包含 name；所需数据不可用时为 nil。"
