L["Run the historical health-snapshot trend formula using the live profile history window, clock and legacy rounding service. Preserve its maximum-health transitions, early stop at full or zero health, weighting, errors and return counts. Empty snapshot arrays retain the original nonfinite result; this is the legacy algorithm rather than a validated forecast."] = "使用实时配置文件的历史窗口、时钟和旧版舍入服务，运行历史生命值快照的趋势公式。保留其最大生命值的过渡、在满血或零血时提前停止、加权、错误和返回值数量。空的快照数组保留原有的非有限结果；这是旧版算法，而不是经过验证的预测。"
