-- en: "Value record field to edit; defaults to unit."
L["Value record field to edit; defaults to unit."] = "要编辑的值记录字段；默认为 unit。"
-- en: "Value returned for every other unit."
L["Value returned for every other unit."] = "对其他所有单位返回的值。"
-- en: "Value returned when unit is player."
L["Value returned when unit is player."] = "单位为 player 时返回的值。"
-- en: "Value to display; false is preserved."
L["Value to display; false is preserved."] = "要显示的值；false 会被保留。"
-- en: "Visit entries in both tables and compare each value with the indexed value in the other table using Lua equality. Normal indexing and equality metamethods apply; nested contents are not compared recursively."
L["Visit entries in both tables and compare each value with the indexed value in the other table using Lua equality. Normal indexing and equality metamethods apply; nested contents are not compared recursively."] = "遍历两个表中的条目，并使用 Lua 相等比较将每个值与另一个表中相应索引的值进行比较。普通的索引和相等元方法都会生效；嵌套内容不会被递归比较。"
-- en: "Weighted health-snapshot change from the original total/count formula; zero for falsy input."
L["Weighted health-snapshot change from the original total/count formula; zero for falsy input."] = "根据原始的总和/计数公式得出的加权生命值快照变化；输入为假值时为零。"
-- en: "Weighting window in seconds; nil or false uses the current profile damage_history setting."
L["Weighting window in seconds; nil or false uses the current profile damage_history setting."] = "加权窗口，单位为秒；为 nil 或 false 时使用当前配置文件的 damage_history 设置。"
-- en: "Whether the original floor-equality or exact numeric-spelling predicate matches."
L["Whether the original floor-equality or exact numeric-spelling predicate matches."] = "原有的向下取整相等或精确数字拼写判断是否匹配。"
-- en: "Whether the text begins with the exact prefix."
L["Whether the text begins with the exact prefix."] = "文本是否以该确切前缀开头。"
-- en: "Whether the text ends with the exact suffix."
L["Whether the text ends with the exact suffix."] = "文本是否以该确切后缀结尾。"
-- en: "Work-limit, data or arithmetic availability reason for nil rate/age."
L["Work-limit, data or arithmetic availability reason for nil rate/age."] = "速率/时长为 nil 时的工作量上限、数据或运算可用性原因。"
-- en: "Wrap text at whitespace boundaries near a target column count. Long words are retained intact."
L["Wrap text at whitespace boundaries near a target column count. Long words are retained intact."] = "在接近目标列数的空白边界处对文本换行。长单词会保持完整。"
-- en: "mana selects the explicit live Mana enum; current reads and forwards the actual UnitPowerType identity, including Mana zero."
L["mana selects the explicit live Mana enum; current reads and forwards the actual UnitPowerType identity, including Mana zero."] = "mana 选择显式的实时 Mana 枚举；current 读取并转发实际的 UnitPowerType 身份，包括值为零的 Mana。"
-- en: "noheals selects damage only; nodmg selects healing only; other readable values select both."
L["noheals selects damage only; nodmg selects healing only; other readable values select both."] = "noheals 只选择伤害；nodmg 只选择治疗；其他可读的值会同时选择两者。"
